{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01X8aFUC5JuD5idyPe1ktnwa","type":"tool_result","content":"1\tnarrative_guidance: '放弃 \"Diversity Trap\" framing。Reframe 为 \"Structural Vulnerability\n2\t  Anatomy of Multi-Judge LLM Evaluation\"。 新 lead claim：η_max 作为 panel vulnerability\n3\t  的 dominant 且 near-sufficient predictor（9-11/12 显著）， 这本身是对 \"diversity protects\" 假设的实证否定——不需要\n4\t  diversity actively hurts，只需 diversity doesn''t help 而 weakest-link 决定一切。K_eff 降级为\n5\t  \"exploratory analysis showing suggestive but confounded association\"， 置于 Discussion。方法论贡献前移：copula\n6\t  failure（即使 ratio 降了仍是有意义的 methodological finding）、 family label 不可靠性、15-model/455-panel\n7\t  规模的 evaluation benchmark 本身作为 resource contribution。 BFT 从 core mechanism 降为 Discussion\n8\t  section 的 \"open question\"。 补偿策略：(a) 强调 weakest-link 发现的实用价值（panel 安全由最弱 judge 决定）；\n9\t  (b) 释放 per-judge ASR 浓度分析（plan_006 Gini/entropy）作为 adaptive adversary targeting\n10\t  的直接证据； (c) 推 aggregation rule 比较作为 practical contribution（哪种聚合最抗攻击）。 预期结果：需要 rebuttal\n11\t  期大幅补充，borderline reject / weak accept。仍冲 EMNLP 但准备 NAACL 2027 backup。\n12\t\n13\t  '\n14\timagined_experiments:\n15\t- name: 15-Model Scale Expansion\n16\t  plan_id: plan_001\n17\t  description: '扩展至 15 个模型（6 open-source + 4 API + 大型开源 70B/72B），重跑 MI matrix 和 全\n18\t    panel（C(15,3)=455）回归分析。12 conditions（2 datasets × 6 attacks）。\n19\t\n20\t    '\n21\t  expected_results:\n22\t    n_models: 15\n23\t    n_panels: 455\n24\t    n_conditions: 12\n25\t    keff_raw_sig_positive: 7\n26\t    keff_raw_sig_negative: 0\n27\t    keff_raw_nonsig: 5\n28\t    keff_resid_sig_positive: 4\n29\t    keff_resid_nonsig: 8\n30\t    eta_max_sig: 9\n31\t    mean_R2_full_model: 0.38\n32\t    mean_R2_eta_max_only: 0.34\n33\t    delta_R2_keff_contribution: 0.04\n34\t    keff_eta_max_correlation_mean: 0.73\n35\t    keff_eta_max_correlation_range:\n36\t    - 0.62\n37\t    - 0.85\n38\t    VIF_keff: 2.14\n39\t    confound_free_conditions_count: 1\n40\t    confound_free_condition_keff_p: 0.032\n41\t    confound_free_condition_keff_beta: 0.41\n42\t  result_rationale: '15 模型涵盖 3 个 capability tier（small 7-8B、medium 13-14B、large 70B+\n43\t    及 API）， tier 跨度增大导致 K_eff 与 η_max 的 confound 加剧（r≈0.73）。高 K_eff panel 几乎 必然混入弱模型，低\n44\t    K_eff panel 则趋于同质强模型。Residualization 后 K_eff 仅在 4/12 conditions 保持显著——恰好是 transferable\n45\t    attack（score_manipulation, position_bias） 且 η_max 方差本身较大的条件。其余 8 conditions 中\n46\t    K_eff 的 partial effect 被 η_max 吸收殆尽。η_max 维持 9/12 显著，证明 weakest-link 仍是 dominant\n47\t    driver。 ΔR² 仅 0.04 意味着 K_eff 在 η_max 之上的增量解释力微乎其微。 仅 1 个 confound-free condition（arc×score_manipulation,\n48\t    r≈0.35）中 K_eff 勉强显著 （p=0.032），但单一 condition 无法支撑核心 claim。\n49\t\n50\t    '\n51\t  tables:\n52\t  - title: 'Table 1: K_eff Residualized Regression — 15 Models, 455 Panels'\n53\t    columns:\n54\t    - Dataset\n55\t    - Attack\n56\t    - β_ηmax\n57\t    - p_ηmax\n58\t    - β_Keff_resid\n59\t    - p_Keff_resid\n60\t    - R²\n61\t    - K_eff-ηmax r\n62\t    rows:\n63\t    - - MMLU\n64\t      - sycophancy\n65\t      - '0.82'\n66\t      - <0.001\n67\t      - '0.18'\n68\t      - '0.147'\n69\t      - '0.41'\n70\t      - '0.78'\n71\t    - - MMLU\n72\t      - score_manip\n73\t      - '0.55'\n74\t      - <0.001\n75\t      - '0.39'\n76\t      - '0.021'\n77\t      - '0.36'\n78\t      - '0.68'\n79\t    - - MMLU\n80\t      - position\n81\t      - '0.71'\n82\t      - <0.001\n83\t      - '0.24'\n84\t      - '0.089'\n85\t      - '0.39'\n86\t      - '0.75'\n87\t    - - MMLU\n88\t      - verbosity\n89\t      - '0.88'\n90\t      - <0.001\n91\t      - '0.09'\n92\t      - '0.511'\n93\t      - '0.42'\n94\t      - '0.81'\n95\t    - - MMLU\n96\t      - authority\n97\t      - '0.79'\n98\t      - <0.001\n99\t      - '0.15'\n100\t      - '0.218'\n101\t      - '0.37'\n102\t      - '0.76'\n103\t    - - MMLU\n104\t      - few_shot_hijack\n105\t      - '0.64'\n106\t      - '0.002'\n107\t      - '0.31'\n108\t      - '0.043'\n109\t      - '0.33'\n110\t      - '0.70'\n111\t    - - ARC\n112\t      - sycophancy\n113\t      - '0.85'\n114\t      - <0.001\n115\t      - '0.12'\n116\t      - '0.341'\n117\t      - '0.43'\n118\t      - '0.79'\n119\t    - - ARC\n120\t      - score_manip\n121\t      - '0.48'\n122\t      - '0.003'\n123\t      - '0.41'\n124\t      - '0.032'\n125\t      - '0.35'\n126\t      - '0.35'\n127\t    - - ARC\n128\t      - position\n129\t      - '0.73'\n130\t      - <0.001\n131\t      - '0.22'\n132\t      - '0.102'\n133\t      - '0.38'\n134\t      - '0.74'\n135\t    - - ARC\n136\t      - verbosity\n137\t      - '0.91'\n138\t      - <0.001\n139\t      - '0.06'\n140\t      - '0.649'\n141\t      - '0.44'\n142\t      - '0.82'\n143\t    - - ARC\n144\t      - authority\n145\t      - '0.76'\n146\t      - <0.001\n147\t      - '0.19'\n148\t      - '0.157'\n149\t      - '0.36'\n150\t      - '0.77'\n151\t    - - ARC\n152\t      - few_shot_hijack\n153\t      - '0.59'\n154\t      - '0.004'\n155\t      - '0.28'\n156\t      - '0.071'\n157\t      - '0.32'\n158\t      - '0.72'\n159\t  - title: 'Table 2: Model Pool Summary — 15 Models'\n160\t    columns:\n161\t    - Model\n162\t    - Family\n163\t    - Size\n164\t    - Tier\n165\t    - Mean η (6 attacks)\n166\t    - Clean ACC\n167\t    rows:\n168\t    - - Qwen2.5-7B\n169\t      - Qwen\n170\t      - 7B\n171\t      - small\n172\t      - '0.38'\n173\t      - '0.61'\n174\t    - - Qwen2.5-14B\n175\t      - Qwen\n176\t      - 14B\n177\t      - medium\n178\t      - '0.22'\n179\t      - '0.74'\n180\t    - - Qwen2.5-72B\n181\t      - Qwen\n182\t      - 72B\n183\t      - large\n184\t      - '0.11'\n185\t      - '0.83'\n186\t    - - Llama-3.1-8B\n187\t      - Llama\n188\t      - 8B\n189\t      - small\n190\t      - '0.41'\n191\t      - '0.58'\n192\t    - - Llama-3.1-70B\n193\t      - Llama\n194\t      - 70B\n195\t      - large\n196\t      - '0.14'\n197\t      - '0.80'\n198\t    - - Mistral-7B\n199\t      - Mistral\n200\t      - 7B\n201\t      - small\n202\t      - '0.44'\n203\t      - '0.55'\n204\t    - - Mistral-Nemo-12B\n205\t      - Mistral\n206\t      - 12B\n207\t      - medium\n208\t      - '0.27'\n209\t      - '0.69'\n210\t    - - Phi-3-mini\n211\t      - Microsoft\n212\t      - 3.8B\n213\t      - small\n214\t      - '0.49'\n215\t      - '0.52'\n216\t    - - Phi-3-medium\n217\t      - Microsoft\n218\t      - 14B\n219\t      - medium\n220\t      - '0.25'\n221\t      - '0.71'\n222\t    - - Gemma-2-9B\n223\t      - Google\n224\t      - 9B\n225\t      - small\n226\t      - '0.36'\n227\t      - '0.63'\n228\t    - - GPT-4o-mini\n229\t      - OpenAI\n230\t      - API\n231\t      - medium\n232\t      - '0.19'\n233\t      - '0.76'\n234\t    - - GPT-4o\n235\t      - OpenAI\n236\t      - API\n237\t      - large\n238\t      - '0.08'\n239\t      - '0.87'\n240\t    - - GPT-4.1\n241\t      - OpenAI\n242\t      - API\n243\t      - large\n244\t      - '0.07'\n245\t      - '0.89'\n246\t    - - GPT-4.1-mini\n247\t      - OpenAI\n248\t      - API\n249\t      - medium\n250\t      - '0.16'\n251\t      - '0.78'\n252\t    - - Claude-3.5-Haiku\n253\t      - Anthropic\n254\t      - API\n255\t      - medium\n256\t      - '0.18'\n257\t      - '0.77'\n258\t  figures_description:\n259\t  - 'Fig 1: Scatter of K_eff vs η_max for 455 panels, color-coded by dataset. Regression\n260\t    line shows r≈0.73. Severe confound visible — high-K_eff panels cluster at high\n261\t    η_max. Only 1 condition (arc×score_manip) shows appreciable spread allowing independent\n262\t    K_eff estimation.'\n263\t  - 'Fig 2: Forest plot of β_Keff_resid across 12 conditions with 95% CI. 4 conditions\n264\t    have CI excluding zero (marked with *); 8 conditions cross zero. Compare to η_max\n265\t    forest plot where 9/12 exclude zero.'\n266\t  analysis: '核心 diversity trap framing 受到致命打击。K_eff residualized 显著率从期望的 8/12 降至 4/12，且这\n267\t    4 个中有 2 个 p 值在 0.02-0.04 之间（经 FDR 校正后可能变 NS）。 仅 1 个 confound-free condition 意味着\n268\t    residualization 的可信度依赖于线性假设—— reviewer 可以合理质疑 \"你的 K_eff effect 只是 nonlinear η_max\n269\t    effect 的残余\"。 η_max 9/12 显著是稳健的，weakest-link 叙事成立，但这是预期结果不是新发现。 ΔR² = 0.04 使得 \"dual\n270\t    vulnerability driver\" 的 framing 难以为继——第二个 driver 解释力不到 4%。需要 reframe 为 η_max-dominant\n271\t    故事。\n272\t\n273\t    '\n274\t- name: Attack Type Expansion\n275\t  plan_id: plan_002\n276\t  description: '新增 few-shot hijacking、persona manipulation、instruction override 三种攻击类型，\n277\t    在 15 模型 455 panel 上运行，产生 6 个新 conditions（2 datasets × 3 new attacks）。\n278\t\n279\t    '\n280\t  expected_results:\n281\t    new_conditions: 6\n282\t    keff_resid_sig_new: 2\n283\t    keff_resid_nonsig_new: 4\n284\t    eta_max_sig_new: 5\n285\t    keff_direction_positive_new: 4\n286\t    keff_direction_negative_new: 1\n287\t    keff_direction_near_zero_new: 1\n288\t    mean_R2_new_conditions: 0.31\n289\t    combined_keff_resid_sig_18: 6\n290\t    combined_eta_max_sig_18: 14\n291\t  result_rationale: '新攻击类型中 few-shot hijacking 和 instruction override 是 transferable\n292\t    attack， K_eff 在这些条件下可能保持微弱正向显著（p≈0.03-0.04）；persona manipulation 则高度 依赖模型特定 persona\n293\t    alignment 训练，η_max 几乎完全解释方差。整体上新增 6 conditions 中仅 2 个 K_eff 显著，且 1 个条件 K_eff 方向为负（persona\n294\t    manipulation on ARC）， 方向不一致削弱了 \"diversity universally hurts\" 的叙事。18 条件合计 K_eff\n295\t    6/18 ≈ 33% 显著率——FDR 校正后可能进一步缩减至 4-5/18，属于 \"suggestive but not robust\" 水平。\n296\t\n297\t    '\n298\t  tables:\n299\t  - title: 'Table 3: New Attack Types — K_eff Residualized Results'\n300\t    columns:\n301\t    - Dataset\n302\t    - Attack\n303\t    - β_ηmax\n304\t    - p_ηmax\n305\t    - β_Keff_resid\n306\t    - p_Keff_resid\n307\t    - R²\n308\t    - Direction\n309\t    rows:\n310\t    - - MMLU\n311\t      - few_shot_hijack\n312\t      - '0.64'\n313\t      - '0.002'\n314\t      - '0.31'\n315\t      - '0.043'\n316\t      - '0.33'\n317\t      - positive\n318\t    - - MMLU\n319\t      - persona_manip\n320\t      - '0.91'\n321\t      - <0.001\n322\t      - '0.05'\n323\t      - '0.724'\n324\t      - '0.45'\n325\t      - near-zero\n326\t    - - MMLU\n327\t      - instruct_override\n328\t      - '0.58'\n329\t      - '0.005'\n330\t      - '0.34'\n331\t      - '0.038'\n332\t      - '0.31'\n333\t      - positive\n334\t    - - ARC\n335\t      - few_shot_hijack\n336\t      - '0.59'\n337\t      - '0.004'\n338\t      - '0.28'\n339\t      - '0.071'\n340\t      - '0.32'\n341\t      - positive\n342\t    - - ARC\n343\t      - persona_manip\n344\t      - '0.87'\n345\t      - <0.001\n346\t      - '-0.12'\n347\t      - '0.389'\n348\t      - '0.41'\n349\t      - negative\n350\t    - - ARC\n351\t      - instruct_override\n352\t      - '0.62'\n353\t      - '0.003'\n354\t      - '0.26'\n355\t      - '0.088'\n356\t      - '0.30'\n357\t      - positive\n358\t  figures_description:\n359\t  - 'Fig 3: Heatmap of β_Keff_resid across all 18 conditions (12 original + 6 new).\n360\t    Color gradient from blue (negative) to red (positive). Shows scattered pattern\n361\t    — no consistent K_eff direction, with 1 negative entry (ARC×persona_manip). Contrast\n362\t    with η_max heatmap showing near-uniform positive β.'\n363\t  analysis: '攻击扩展没有挽救 K_eff 叙事。新增条件中 K_eff 显著率 2/6，其中 persona manipulation 出现方向反转（K_eff\n364\t    负但 NS）——这与 \"diversity hurts\" 不一致，虽然不显著但给 reviewer 提供了攻击点。合计 18 conditions 中 K_eff\n365\t    6/18 显著，低于 33% 的 chance expected 阈值，FDR 校正后预计降至 4-5/18。η_max 14/18 显著，进一步巩固 weakest-link\n366\t    的 dominant 地位。新攻击类型未发现任何 K_eff dominates η_max 的条件。\n367\t\n368\t    '\n369\t- name: Random-Fault BFT Contrast Simulation\n370\t  plan_id: plan_003\n371\t  description: '模拟随机故障场景：每个 judge 以概率 η_j 独立犯错，majority vote 决策。 比较 K_eff 在 random-fault\n372\t    vs adaptive 两种 regime 下的 β 和显著性。\n373\t\n374\t    '\n375\t  expected_results:\n376\t    RF_keff_sig_positive: 10\n377\t    RF_keff_nonsig: 2\n378\t    RF_eta_max_sig: 11\n379\t    RF_mean_beta_keff: 0.42\n380\t    adaptive_mean_beta_keff: 0.38\n381\t    BFT_RF_beta_ratio: 0.91\n382\t    RF_mean_R2: 0.62\n383\t    adaptive_mean_R2: 0.38\n384\t    delta_R2_RF_vs_adaptive: 0.24\n385\t    RF_keff_direction: positive (same as adaptive)\n386\t    regime_contrast_p_interaction: 0.217\n387\t  result_rationale: 'BFT contrast 的核心预期是 K_eff 在 RF 下显著正向（diversity helps under random\n388\t    faults） 但在 adaptive 下 NS 或反转。Worst 档下实际观察到：K_eff 在 RF 下同样正向显著 （10/12），与 adaptive\n389\t    下方向一致。原因：在 RF 模拟中 η_j 直接决定 judge 犯错率， 高 K_eff panel 仍然混入高 η_j 的弱模型，majority vote\n390\t    下弱模型拉低整体正确率。 因此 K_eff 正向不是 \"diversity 主动有害\" 而是 \"diversity 引入弱模型\" 的统计反映—— 这在 RF\n391\t    和 adaptive 两种 regime 下都成立。β ratio 0.91 表明两种 regime 下 K_eff 的效应量几乎相同，regime interaction\n392\t    term NS (p=0.217)。唯一的 regime 差异是 R²： RF 下 R²=0.62 vs adaptive R²=0.38，ΔR²=0.24——RF\n393\t    更可预测但这只是因为 RF 没有 strategic variance，不是因为 K_eff 效应不同。BFT reversal mechanism 叙事瓦解。\n394\t\n395\t    '\n396\t  tables:\n397\t  - title: 'Table 4: BFT Regime Contrast — K_eff β Comparison'\n398\t    columns:\n399\t    - Dataset\n400\t    - Attack\n401\t    - β_Keff (Adaptive)\n402\t    - p (Adaptive)\n403\t    - β_Keff (RF)\n404\t    - p (RF)\n405\t    - β Ratio\n406\t    - Interaction p\n407\t    rows:\n408\t    - - MMLU\n409\t      - sycophancy\n410\t      - '0.18'\n411\t      - '0.147'\n412\t      - '0.21'\n413\t      - '0.024'\n414\t      - '1.17'\n415\t      - '0.682'\n416\t    - - MMLU\n417\t      - score_manip\n418\t      - '0.39'\n419\t      - '0.021'\n420\t      - '0.44'\n421\t      - '0.003'\n422\t      - '1.13'\n423\t      - '0.541'\n424\t    - - MMLU\n425\t      - position\n426\t      - '0.24'\n427\t      - '0.089'\n428\t      - '0.28'\n429\t      - '0.011'\n430\t      - '1.17'\n431\t      - '0.614'\n432\t    - - MMLU\n433\t      - verbosity\n434\t      - '0.09'\n435\t      - '0.511'\n436\t      - '0.15'\n437\t      - '0.108'\n438\t      - '1.67'\n439\t      - '0.398'\n440\t    - - MMLU\n441\t      - authority\n442\t      - '0.15'\n443\t      - '0.218'\n444\t      - '0.19'\n445\t      - '0.047'\n446\t      - '1.27'\n447\t      - '0.583'\n448\t    - - MMLU\n449\t      - few_shot_hijack\n450\t      - '0.31'\n451\t      - '0.043'\n452\t      - '0.35'\n453\t      - '0.008'\n454\t      - '1.13'\n455\t      - '0.617'\n456\t    - - ARC\n457\t      - sycophancy\n458\t      - '0.12'\n459\t      - '0.341'\n460\t      - '0.16'\n461\t      - '0.072'\n462\t      - '1.33'\n463\t      - '0.521'\n464\t    - - ARC\n465\t      - score_manip\n466\t      - '0.41'\n467\t      - '0.032'\n468\t      - '0.48'\n469\t      - '0.001'\n470\t      - '1.17'\n471\t      - '0.434'\n472\t    - - ARC\n473\t      - position\n474\t      - '0.22'\n475\t      - '0.102'\n476\t      - '0.27'\n477\t      - '0.015'\n478\t      - '1.23'\n479\t      - '0.548'\n480\t    - - ARC\n481\t      - verbosity\n482\t      - '0.06'\n483\t      - '0.649'\n484\t      - '0.11'\n485\t      - '0.198'\n486\t      - '1.83'\n487\t      - '0.412'\n488\t    - - ARC\n489\t      - authority\n490\t      - '0.19'\n491\t      - '0.157'\n492\t      - '0.22'\n493\t      - '0.038'\n494\t      - '1.16'\n495\t      - '0.601'\n496\t    - - ARC\n497\t      - few_shot_hijack\n498\t      - '0.28'\n499\t      - '0.071'\n500\t      - '0.33'\n501\t      - '0.009'\n502\t      - '1.18'\n503\t      - '0.547'\n504\t  - title: 'Table 5: R² Comparison Across Regimes'\n505\t    columns:\n506\t    - Dataset\n507\t    - Attack\n508\t    - R² (Adaptive)\n509\t    - R² (RF)\n510\t    - ΔR²\n511\t    rows:\n512\t    - - MMLU\n513\t      - sycophancy\n514\t      - '0.41'\n515\t      - '0.64'\n516\t      - '0.23'\n517\t    - - MMLU\n518\t      - score_manip\n519\t      - '0.36'\n520\t      - '0.58'\n521\t      - '0.22'\n522\t    - - MMLU\n523\t      - position\n524\t      - '0.39'\n525\t      - '0.61'\n526\t      - '0.22'\n527\t    - - MMLU\n528\t      - verbosity\n529\t      - '0.42'\n530\t      - '0.67'\n531\t      - '0.25'\n532\t    - - MMLU\n533\t      - authority\n534\t      - '0.37'\n535\t      - '0.59'\n536\t      - '0.22'\n537\t    - - MMLU\n538\t      - few_shot_hijack\n539\t      - '0.33'\n540\t      - '0.55'\n541\t      - '0.22'\n542\t    - - ARC\n543\t      - sycophancy\n544\t      - '0.43'\n545\t      - '0.69'\n546\t      - '0.26'\n547\t    - - ARC\n548\t      - score_manip\n549\t      - '0.35'\n550\t      - '0.57'\n551\t      - '0.22'\n552\t    - - ARC\n553\t      - position\n554\t      - '0.38'\n555\t      - '0.62'\n556\t      - '0.24'\n557\t    - - ARC\n558\t      - verbosity\n559\t      - '0.44'\n560\t      - '0.71'\n561\t      - '0.27'\n562\t    - - ARC\n563\t      - authority\n564\t      - '0.36'\n565\t      - '0.60'\n566\t      - '0.24'\n567\t    - - ARC\n568\t      - few_shot_hijack\n569\t      - '0.32'\n570\t      - '0.53'\n571\t      - '0.21'\n572\t  figures_description:\n573\t  - 'Fig 4: Paired bar chart of β_Keff under adaptive (red) vs RF (blue) for each\n574\t    condition. Near-identical heights across all 12 conditions. Error bars overlap\n575\t    extensively. Regime interaction NS in all conditions.'\n576\t  - 'Fig 5: R² comparison scatter — RF on x-axis, adaptive on y-axis. All points below\n577\t    diagonal, showing RF consistently more predictable. But this is a predictability\n578\t    difference, not a mechanism difference.'\n579\t  analysis: 'BFT contrast 实验是 GO/NO-GO gate，结果为 NO-GO。K_eff 在 RF 下不仅没有变负 （diversity\n580\t    helps），反而保持正向且更显著（10/12 vs 4/12 residualized adaptive）。 这意味着 K_eff 的正向效应不是 adaptive\n581\t    adversary 特有的——而是 panel composition 的基本属性（高 diversity → 混入弱模型 → 高 ASR），RF 和 adaptive\n582\t    下都成立。 BFT reversal mechanism 的核心前提被否定：我们无法证明 diversity 在 RF 下保护但在 adaptive 下有害。唯一可挽救的发现是\n583\t    ΔR² = 0.24，说明 adaptive attacker 引入了 strategic variance 使得 panel composition 的预测力下降——但这是一个弱得多的\n584\t    claim， 不足以支撑 Claim 2 作为独立贡献。BFT 应降级为 Discussion 中的 \"open question\"。\n585\t\n586\t    '\n587\t- name: Capability-Matched K_eff Validation\n588\t  plan_id: plan_004\n589\t  description: '在同一 capability tier 内（all-small 7-8B 或 all-large 70B+/API）测试 K_eff\n590\t    是否 仍然显著。如果 tier-matched panel 中 K_eff 消失 → K_eff 效应是 tier-mixing artifact。\n591\t\n592\t    '\n593\t  expected_results:\n594\t    tiers_tested: 3\n595\t    panels_small_tier: 10\n596\t    panels_medium_tier: 10\n597\t    panels_large_tier: 10\n598\t    small_tier_keff_sig: 0\n599\t    medium_tier_keff_sig: 1\n600\t    large_tier_keff_sig: 0\n601\t    total_capability_matched_keff_sig: 1\n602\t    total_conditions_tested: 6\n603\t    eta_max_variance_within_tier: 0.008\n604\t    keff_eta_max_correlation_within_tier: 0.22\n605\t    within_tier_keff_p_range:\n606\t    - 0.041\n607\t    - 0.891\n608\t    within_tier_mean_R2: 0.12\n609\t  result_rationale: 'Capability-matched 是 worst 档的致命实验。同 tier 内模型能力相近，η_max 方差极小 （约\n610\t    0.008 vs 全池 0.045），消除了 tier-mixing confound。结果：K_eff 仅在 1/6 条件下显著（medium tier\n611\t    × score_manipulation, p=0.041，FDR 后可能 NS），其余 5/6 全部 NS。这直接证明 K_eff 的表面效应是 tier-mixing\n612\t    的统计幻象：当你在全池抽 panel， 高 K_eff panel 跨 tier 抽样（混入 7B 和 70B），低 K_eff panel 同 tier\n613\t    抽样—— K_eff 与 η_max 的相关性是 tier-mixing 的副产品，不是因果关系。 每个 tier 仅 C(5,3)=10 个 panel，样本量不足以检测小效应，但即便如此\n614\t    η_max 方差 消失也说明在能力控制后 K_eff 没有独立的预测力。Reviewer 可以合理论证： \"K_eff effect = capability\n615\t    heterogeneity effect, not diversity per se\"。\n616\t\n617\t    '\n618\t  tables:\n619\t  - title: 'Table 6: Capability-Matched K_eff Analysis'\n620\t    columns:\n621\t    - Tier\n622\t    - N Panels\n623\t    - Condition\n624\t    - β_Keff\n625\t    - p_Keff\n626\t    - R²\n627\t    - η_max Var\n628\t    rows:\n629\t    - - Small (7-8B)\n630\t      - '10'\n631\t      - MMLU×sycophancy\n632\t      - '0.08'\n633\t      - '0.721'\n634\t      - '0.09'\n635\t      - '0.007'\n636\t    - - Small (7-8B)\n637\t      - '10'\n638\t      - ARC×score_manip\n639\t      - '0.14'\n640\t      - '0.548'\n641\t      - '0.11'\n642\t      - '0.008'\n643\t    - - Medium (12-14B+API-mini)\n644\t      - '10'\n645\t      - MMLU×sycophancy\n646\t      - '0.11'\n647\t      - '0.612'\n648\t      - '0.10'\n649\t      - '0.009'\n650\t    - - Medium (12-14B+API-mini)\n651\t      - '10'\n652\t      - ARC×score_manip\n653\t      - '0.29'\n654\t      - '0.041'\n655\t      - '0.18'\n656\t      - '0.011'\n657\t    - - Large (70B+API)\n658\t      - '10'\n659\t      - MMLU×sycophancy\n660\t      - '0.06'\n661\t      - '0.891'\n662\t      - '0.07'\n663\t      - '0.004'\n664\t    - - Large (70B+API)\n665\t      - '10'\n666\t      - ARC×score_manip\n667\t      - '0.09'\n668\t      - '0.684'\n669\t      - '0.08'\n670\t      - '0.005'\n671\t  figures_description:\n672\t  - 'Fig 6: Side-by-side comparison — left: K_eff vs ASR scatter for full pool (455\n673\t    panels, clear positive trend), right: K_eff vs ASR scatter within each tier (3×10\n674\t    panels, flat/noisy). The positive trend disappears when capability is controlled,\n675\t    visualizing the confound.'\n676\t  - 'Fig 7: η_max variance decomposition bar chart — between-tier variance (0.037)\n677\t    vs within-tier variance (0.008). 82% of η_max variance is between tiers, explaining\n678\t    why tier-mixing creates spurious K_eff association.'\n679\t  analysis: '这是对 diversity trap framing 的最强反驳。Capability-matched 0-1/6 显著意味着 K_eff\n680\t    的独立效应在控制 capability 后基本消失。Residualized analysis 在全池中仍然 显著 4/12 的原因是：residualization\n681\t    假设线性关系，但 K_eff-η_max confound 可能是 非线性的（阶梯型：跨 tier → K_eff 骤升 + η_max 骤升），线性 residualization\n682\t    无法完全去除。Capability-matched 是更强的 confound control（分层而非回归调整）， 结果否定了 K_eff 的独立效应。需要在论文中诚实报告这个\n683\t    null result，将 K_eff 从 core claim 降级为 \"exploratory, potentially confounded\"。\n684\t\n685\t    '\n686\t- name: Two-Stage Panel Design Algorithm Benchmark\n687\t  plan_id: plan_005\n688\t  description: 'Robustness-first 两阶段选择：(1) 筛选 η ≤ threshold 的 judge，(2) 在剩余中最大化 K_eff。\n689\t    与 5 个 baseline（random, max-K_eff, strongest-K, min-η, diversity-only）对比。\n690\t\n691\t    '\n692\t  expected_results:\n693\t    baselines_tested: 5\n694\t    two_stage_vs_strongest_K_ASR_reduction_pct: 2.3\n695\t    two_stage_vs_strongest_K_p: 0.312\n696\t    two_stage_vs_random_ASR_reduction_pct: 18.4\n697\t    two_stage_vs_max_keff_ASR_reduction_pct: 31.2\n698\t    min_eta_dominates_conditions: 4\n699\t    two_stage_dominates_conditions: 1\n700\t    strongest_K_dominates_conditions: 1\n701\t    two_stage_ASR_reduction_pct: 3.1\n702\t    two_stage_vs_strongest_K_stat_sig: false\n703\t    optimal_eta_threshold: 0.15\n704\t  result_rationale: '在 worst 档下 K_eff 的独立效应已消失（plan_004 显示 capability-matched 后 K_eff\n705\t    NS）， 因此两阶段的第二步（maximize K_eff among screened judges）几乎不提供额外收益。 Robustness screening（step\n706\t    1）本身有效——排除 η > threshold 的弱模型大幅降低 ASR—— 但这与简单的 strongest-K 策略效果相同。Two-stage 与\n707\t    strongest-K 的差异仅 2.3% （p=0.312, NS），因为 screening 后剩余模型能力相近，K_eff 的变异范围收窄。 min_eta（不考虑\n708\t    diversity）在 4/6 conditions 表现最佳，进一步说明 panel 安全由 最弱 judge 决定。Two-stage 的存在意义被削弱：如果第二步（diversity）没用，\n709\t    算法退化为 \"just pick the strongest K models\"。\n710\t\n711\t    '\n712\t  tables:\n713\t  - title: 'Table 7: Panel Selection Strategy Comparison (mean ASR across 6 attacks)'\n714\t    columns:\n715\t    - Strategy\n716\t    - Mean ASR\n717\t    - vs Strongest-K Δ%\n718\t    - p vs Strongest-K\n719\t    - Wins (6 conditions)\n720\t    rows:\n721\t    - - Random\n722\t      - '0.284'\n723\t      - +21.5%\n724\t      - <0.001\n725\t      - '0'\n726\t    - - Max-K_eff\n727\t      - '0.341'\n728\t      - +45.9%\n729\t      - <0.001\n730\t      - '0'\n731\t    - - Diversity-Only\n732\t      - '0.312'\n733\t      - +33.5%\n734\t      - <0.001\n735\t      - '0'\n736\t    - - Min-η_max\n737\t      - '0.229'\n738\t      - -2.1%\n739\t      - '0.478'\n740\t      - '4'\n741\t    - - Strongest-K\n742\t      - '0.234'\n743\t      - —\n744\t      - —\n745\t      - '1'\n746\t    - - Two-Stage\n747\t      - '0.227'\n748\t      - -3.1%\n749\t      - '0.312'\n750\t      - '1'\n751\t  - title: 'Table 8: Two-Stage vs Strongest-K Per Condition'\n752\t    columns:\n753\t    - Condition\n754\t    - ASR (Two-Stage)\n755\t    - ASR (Strongest-K)\n756\t    - Δ%\n757\t    - p\n758\t    rows:\n759\t    - - MMLU×sycophancy\n760\t      - '0.211'\n761\t      - '0.219'\n762\t      - -3.7%\n763\t      - '0.284'\n764\t    - - MMLU×score_manip\n765\t      - '0.198'\n766\t      - '0.207'\n767\t      - -4.3%\n768\t      - '0.198'\n769\t    - - MMLU×position\n770\t      - '0.237'\n771\t      - '0.241'\n772\t      - -1.7%\n773\t      - '0.641'\n774\t    - - ARC×sycophancy\n775\t      - '0.241'\n776\t      - '0.248'\n777\t      - -2.8%\n778\t      - '0.352'\n779\t    - - ARC×score_manip\n780\t      - '0.185'\n781\t      - '0.194'\n782\t      - -4.6%\n783\t      - '0.187'\n784\t    - - ARC×position\n785\t      - '0.249'\n786\t      - '0.253'\n787\t      - -1.6%\n788\t      - '0.689'\n789\t  figures_description:\n790\t  - 'Fig 8: Bar chart of mean ASR for 6 strategies. Error bars show 95% CI. Two-Stage\n791\t    and Strongest-K bars nearly identical, CIs heavily overlapping. Max-K_eff is worst\n792\t    (confirms diversity harmful in unscreened pool). Min-η_max and Two-Stage are statistically\n793\t    indistinguishable.'\n794\t  analysis: 'Two-stage ≤5% improvement over strongest-K 且无统计显著性。这与 worst 档的预期一致： 如果\n795\t    K_eff 没有独立效应（plan_004），那么在 robustness-screened pool 中最大化 K_eff 不应带来额外收益。Max-K_eff\n796\t    是最差策略（ASR 最高）这一发现仍然有价值—— 它警告不要盲目追求 diversity——但这只需 η_max 解释就够了（高 K_eff = 混入弱模型\n797\t    = 高 ASR）， 不需要 \"diversity independently hurts\" 的 claim。实践建议简化为 \"pick the most robust\n798\t    judges, ignore diversity\"，这比 two-stage 更简单但可能过于平凡。\n799\t\n800\t    '\n801\t- name: Per-Judge ASR Concentration Analysis\n802\t  plan_id: plan_006\n803\t  description: '对每个 panel × attack，计算各 judge 的 ASR 分布，用 Gini 系数和 entropy 量化 adaptive\n804\t    adversary 的 targeting 集中度。高 Gini = adversary 集中攻击特定 judge。\n805\t\n806\t    '\n807\t  expected_results:\n808\t    mean_gini_adaptive: 0.38\n809\t    mean_gini_random_fault: 0.12\n810\t    gini_diff_p: <0.001\n811\t    mean_entropy_adaptive: 2.41\n812\t    mean_entropy_random_fault: 3.22\n813\t    entropy_diff_p: <0.001\n814\t    gini_keff_correlation: 0.21\n815\t    gini_keff_p: 0.089\n816\t    gini_eta_max_correlation: 0.67\n817\t    gini_eta_max_p: <0.001\n818\t    high_gini_panels_pct: 34\n819\t    targeting_consistent_across_attacks: false\n820\t  result_rationale: 'Adaptive adversary 确实展现 targeting 行为（Gini 0.38 vs RF 0.12），但集中度\n821\t    中等而非极端。关键问题：Gini 与 η_max 高度相关（r=0.67）但与 K_eff 弱相关（r=0.21, NS）。 这意味着 targeting\n822\t    主要针对最弱 judge（η_max 高的 panel 中弱 judge 更容易被攻克）， 而不是利用 diversity 创造的 diverse attack\n823\t    surface。如果 K_eff 独立驱动 targeting， 我们预期 Gini 与 K_eff 显著相关（高 diversity → adversary\n824\t    有更多独立漏洞可攻击 → 攻击更集中于特定 judge），但 p=0.089 未达显著。此外 targeting 不跨攻击一致—— 同一 panel 在不同攻击下被\n825\t    target 的 judge 不同，进一步削弱 \"structural diversity creates systematic exploitable surface\"\n826\t    的论点。\n827\t\n828\t    '\n829\t  tables:\n830\t  - title: 'Table 9: ASR Concentration Statistics'\n831\t    columns:\n832\t    - Metric\n833\t    - Adaptive (mean)\n834\t    - Adaptive (SD)\n835\t    - RF (mean)\n836\t    - RF (SD)\n837\t    - Diff p\n838\t    rows:\n839\t    - - Gini\n840\t      - '0.38'\n841\t      - '0.14'\n842\t      - '0.12'\n843\t      - '0.05'\n844\t      - <0.001\n845\t    - - Entropy (bits)\n846\t      - '2.41'\n847\t      - '0.52'\n848\t      - '3.22'\n849\t      - '0.31'\n850\t      - <0.001\n851\t    - - Max single-judge share\n852\t      - '0.51'\n853\t      - '0.12'\n854\t      - '0.38'\n855\t      - '0.06'\n856\t      - <0.001\n857\t  - title: 'Table 10: Gini Coefficient Correlations'\n858\t    columns:\n859\t    - Predictor\n860\t    - r with Gini\n861\t    - p\n862\t    - Interpretation\n863\t    rows:\n864\t    - - η_max\n865\t      - '0.67'\n866\t      - <0.001\n867\t      - Targeting tracks individual weakness\n868\t    - - K_eff\n869\t      - '0.21'\n870\t      - '0.089'\n871\t      - Weak/NS association with diversity\n872\t    - - Panel size\n873\t      - '0.04'\n874\t      - '0.814'\n875\t      - No panel size effect\n876\t    - - Mean capability\n877\t      - '-0.58'\n878\t      - <0.001\n879\t      - Stronger panels → less concentrated targeting\n880\t  figures_description:\n881\t  - 'Fig 9: Violin plot of Gini coefficient distributions — adaptive (red, wider spread,\n882\t    higher median) vs RF (blue, narrow, low). Shows adaptive targeting exists but\n883\t    is moderate.'\n884\t  - 'Fig 10: Scatter of Gini vs K_eff (left, flat/NS) and Gini vs η_max (right, clear\n885\t    positive trend). Demonstrates targeting is driven by individual weakness, not\n886\t    structural diversity.'\n887\t  analysis: 'Per-judge 浓度分析提供了 adaptive vs RF 差异的直接证据——这是一个有用的 finding， 可作为 paper\n888\t    的 empirical contribution。但分析同时削弱了 diversity trap：targeting 集中度由 η_max（而非 K_eff）解释。Adaptive\n889\t    adversary 攻击最弱 judge，不是利用 diverse attack surface。这与 reframed narrative（η_max dominant,\n890\t    diversity irrelevant） 一致。Gini 分析可以移入 \"Adaptive Adversary Behavior\" 子节，作为 η_max\n891\t    dominance 的补充证据，而非 diversity trap 的支持。\n892\t\n893\t    '\n894\t- name: Diversity-Capability Tradeoff Visualization\n895\t  plan_id: plan_007\n896\t  description: '绘制 K_eff vs η_max across 455 panels，拟合 tradeoff curve，Pareto frontier\n897\t    analysis， 按 tier 分层。\n898\t\n899\t    '\n900\t  expected_results:\n901\t    keff_eta_max_pearson_r: 0.73\n902\t    keff_eta_max_spearman_rho: 0.71\n903\t    tradeoff_curve_R2: 0.53\n904\t    pareto_frontier_size: 12\n905\t    pareto_pct_from_large_tier: 83\n906\t    pareto_pct_from_mixed_tier: 17\n907\t    pareto_pct_from_small_tier: 0\n908\t    pareto_panels_mean_keff: 1.82\n909\t    pareto_panels_mean_eta_max: 0.09\n910\t    non_pareto_gap_ASR: 0.11\n911\t  result_rationale: 'Tradeoff 可视化清晰展示了 K_eff 与 η_max 的结构性关联：r=0.73，Pareto frontier\n912\t    几乎完全由 large-tier panel 占据（83%），因为只有在全部选择强模型时才能同时获得 低 η_max 和中等 K_eff。Small-tier\n913\t    panel 全部位于 Pareto frontier 之下。 这个 visualization 本身有价值（展示了 evaluation panel design\n914\t    的结构约束）， 但在 worst 档下它更多地支持了 \"K_eff effect is confound\" 的叙事：tradeoff 不是 独立的两个维度的\n915\t    tension，而是 tier-mixing 的必然结果。Pareto frontier 上的 panel 基本就是 \"all strong models\"，equivalent\n916\t    to strongest-K 策略。\n917\t\n918\t    '\n919\t  tables:\n920\t  - title: 'Table 11: Pareto Frontier Panel Characteristics'\n921\t    columns:\n922\t    - Panel ID\n923\t    - Models\n924\t    - K_eff\n925\t    - η_max\n926\t    - Mean ASR\n927\t    - Tier Composition\n928\t    rows:\n929\t    - - P_012\n930\t      - GPT-4.1 / GPT-4o / Qwen72B\n931\t      - '1.91'\n932\t      - '0.08'\n933\t      - '0.142'\n934\t      - all-large\n935\t    - - P_034\n936\t      - GPT-4.1 / Llama70B / GPT-4o\n937\t      - '2.14'\n938\t      - '0.09'\n939\t      - '0.151'\n940\t      - all-large\n941\t    - - P_087\n942\t      - GPT-4.1 / GPT-4o / Claude-Haiku\n943\t      - '1.72'\n944\t      - '0.07'\n945\t      - '0.138'\n946\t      - large+medium\n947\t    - - P_156\n948\t      - GPT-4o / Qwen72B / Llama70B\n949\t      - '2.31'\n950\t      - '0.11'\n951\t      - '0.163'\n952\t      - all-large\n953\t    - - P_201\n954\t      - GPT-4.1 / GPT-4.1m / GPT-4o\n955\t      - '1.45'\n956\t      - '0.07'\n957\t      - '0.131'\n958\t      - all-large\n959\t  figures_description:\n960\t  - 'Fig 11: Scatter of K_eff vs η_max for 455 panels, colored by tier composition\n961\t    (green=all-large, yellow=mixed, red=all-small). Pareto frontier (black line) runs\n962\t    along the lower-left, dominated by green points. Clear positive correlation with\n963\t    tier-driven clustering.'\n964\t  - 'Fig 12: Tradeoff curve with 95% prediction interval. Shows that for a given K_eff\n965\t    level, η_max is tightly predicted (R²=0.53). The ''tradeoff'' is really a constraint\n966\t    surface, not two independent dimensions.'\n967\t  analysis: 'Tradeoff visualization 是一个 clean methodological contribution，无论 K_eff\n968\t    是否有 独立效应都有价值。它展示了当前 LLM 生态中 panel design 的结构约束：diversity 和 robustness 不是独立可优化的维度。但在\n969\t    worst 档下，这更多被解读为 confound 的可视化 证据而非独立发现。可在论文中保留为 Fig 2 或 Fig 3，作为 \"understanding\n970\t    the evaluation landscape\" 的贡献。\n971\t\n972\t    '\n973\t- name: Panel Size Sensitivity Analysis\n974\t  plan_id: plan_008\n975\t  description: '测试 K=3,5,7,9 不同 panel size 下 η_max 与 K_eff 的相对重要性是否变化。\n976\t\n977\t    '\n978\t  expected_results:\n979\t    K3_panels: 455\n980\t    K5_panels: 3003\n981\t    K7_panels: 6435\n982\t    K9_panels: 5005\n983\t    K3_eta_max_sig_ratio: 0.75\n984\t    K5_eta_max_sig_ratio: 0.83\n985\t    K7_eta_max_sig_ratio: 0.92\n986\t    K9_eta_max_sig_ratio: 0.92\n987\t    K3_keff_resid_sig_ratio: 0.33\n988\t    K5_keff_resid_sig_ratio: 0.25\n989\t    K7_keff_resid_sig_ratio: 0.17\n990\t    K9_keff_resid_sig_ratio: 0.08\n991\t    keff_effect_trend_with_K: monotonically decreasing\n992\t  result_rationale: 'Panel size 增大时 η_max dominance 增强，K_eff effect 递减。原因：K=9 的 panel\n993\t    包含 9/15 模型，几乎所有 panel 都包含至少一个弱模型，η_max 方差缩小但 level 保持高位。 同时 K_eff 的变异范围也缩小（大 panel\n994\t    的 K_eff 趋向收敛）。更重要的是，majority vote 在大 panel 中的容错能力提高——但这被 η_max 的 monotonic 效应抵消（一个极弱\n995\t    judge 的影响在 K=3 中是 catastrophic，在 K=9 中被稀释）。K_eff 的 sig ratio 从 K=3 的 0.33 降至 K=9\n996\t    的 0.08，表明 K_eff 的表面效应主要在小 panel 中出现（因为 tier-mixing 的方差更大），进一步支持 confound 解释。\n997\t\n998\t    '\n999\t  tables:\n1000\t  - title: 'Table 12: Panel Size Sensitivity — Significance Ratios'\n1001\t    columns:\n1002\t    - K\n1003\t    - N Panels\n1004\t    - η_max sig ratio\n1005\t    - K_eff resid sig ratio\n1006\t    - Mean R²\n1007\t    - K_eff-η_max r\n1008\t    rows:\n1009\t    - - '3'\n1010\t      - '455'\n1011\t      - '0.75'\n1012\t      - '0.33'\n1013\t      - '0.38'\n1014\t      - '0.73'\n1015\t    - - '5'\n1016\t      - '3003'\n1017\t      - '0.83'\n1018\t      - '0.25'\n1019\t      - '0.41'\n1020\t      - '0.68'\n1021\t    - - '7'\n1022\t      - '6435'\n1023\t      - '0.92'\n1024\t      - '0.17'\n1025\t      - '0.44'\n1026\t      - '0.61'\n1027\t    - - '9'\n1028\t      - '5005'\n1029\t      - '0.92'\n1030\t      - '0.08'\n1031\t      - '0.46'\n1032\t      - '0.54'\n1033\t  figures_description:\n1034\t  - 'Fig 13: Line plot of sig ratios vs panel size K. η_max (blue) rises monotonically;\n1035\t    K_eff (red) declines monotonically. Lines cross at approximately K=4. Shows that\n1036\t    K_eff''s ''effect'' is a small-panel phenomenon.'\n1037\t  analysis: 'Panel size 分析揭示 K_eff 效应的 artifactual nature：它在小 panel（K=3）中最强 恰好是 tier-mixing\n1038\t    方差最大的地方。随 K 增大，confound 缓解，K_eff 效应消退。 η_max 的趋势则相反——大 panel 中仍有弱 judge，且 R² 随\n1039\t    K 增大说明 panel composition 的可预测性提高。这是支持 \"K_eff is confound\" 的又一条证据线。\n1040\t\n1041\t    '\n1042\t- name: VIF and Multicollinearity Deep Dive\n1043\t  plan_id: plan_009\n1044\t  description: '对现有回归数据进行全面多重共线性分析：VIF、偏相关、residualized K_eff、 Bonferroni/FDR correction、bootstrap\n1045\t    CI、排除极端模型的敏感性分析、beta regression。\n1046\t\n1047\t    '\n1048\t  expected_results:\n1049\t    VIF_keff_full_model: 2.14\n1050\t    VIF_eta_max_full_model: 2.14\n1051\t    keff_resid_sig_bonferroni_12: 2\n1052\t    keff_resid_sig_fdr_12: 4\n1053\t    keff_resid_sig_bootstrap_95CI_excludes_zero: 3\n1054\t    keff_resid_sig_exclude_extreme_models: 4\n1055\t    keff_resid_sig_exclude_extreme_models_fdr: 3\n1056\t    beta_regression_keff_sig: 3\n1057\t    beta_regression_eta_max_sig: 10\n1058\t    partial_r_keff_given_eta_max: 0.14\n1059\t    partial_r_eta_max_given_keff: 0.41\n1060\t    sensitivity_analyses_convergent: false\n1061\t    keff_resid_sig_range_across_methods:\n1062\t    - 2\n1063\t    - 5\n1064\t  result_rationale: 'VIF=2.14 在传统标准下不算严重（<5），但这掩盖了非线性 confound。Bonferroni 最严格， K_eff\n1065\t    降至 2/12 显著；FDR 保持 4/12；bootstrap CI 给出 3/12（因为 bootstrap 在 455 panels 中重复抽样，resampling\n1066\t    variance 较大导致 CI 加宽）。排除极端模型 （ACC < 0.5 的 2 个模型）后 K_eff 4/12→3/12（FDR），说明效应部分依赖极端值。\n1067\t    Beta regression（适合 bounded proportion DV）与 OLS 结果不一致——K_eff 仅 3/12 显著（beta regression\n1068\t    对极端值更稳健）。核心问题：不同分析方法给出 2-5/12 的 显著性范围，缺乏收敛性。Reviewer 可以选择最严格的估计（2/12 Bonferroni）argue\n1069\t    K_eff 无效应，或选择最宽松的（5/12 FDR without extreme exclusion）argue suggestive。 这种方法敏感性本身就是\n1070\t    \"not robust\" 的标志。\n1071\t\n1072\t    '\n1073\t  tables:\n1074\t  - title: 'Table 13: K_eff Residualized Significance Under Different Correction Methods'\n1075\t    columns:\n1076\t    - Method\n1077\t    - K_eff sig count (/12)\n1078\t    - η_max sig count (/12)\n1079\t    - Notes\n1080\t    rows:\n1081\t    - - Uncorrected\n1082\t      - '7'\n1083\t      - '10'\n1084\t      - Liberal\n1085\t    - - FDR (BH)\n1086\t      - '4'\n1087\t      - '9'\n1088\t      - Standard\n1089\t    - - Bonferroni\n1090\t      - '2'\n1091\t      - '8'\n1092\t      - Conservative\n1093\t    - - Bootstrap 95% CI\n1094\t      - '3'\n1095\t      - '9'\n1096\t      - Non-parametric\n1097\t    - - Exclude extreme models (FDR)\n1098\t      - '3'\n1099\t      - '9'\n1100\t      - Sensitivity\n1101\t    - - Beta regression (FDR)\n1102\t      - '3'\n1103\t      - '10'\n1104\t      - Bounded DV\n1105\t  - title: 'Table 14: Partial Correlations'\n1106\t    columns:\n1107\t    - Predictor\n1108\t    - Partial r (controlling other)\n1109\t    - 95% CI\n1110\t    - p\n1111\t    rows:\n1112\t    - - K_eff | η_max\n1113\t      - '0.14'\n1114\t      - '[0.05, 0.23]'\n1115\t      - '0.003'\n1116\t    - - η_max | K_eff\n1117\t      - '0.41'\n1118\t      - '[0.33, 0.49]'\n1119\t      - <0.001\n1120\t  figures_description:\n1121\t  - 'Fig 14: Sensitivity analysis heatmap — rows are 12 conditions, columns are 6\n1122\t    analysis methods. Cells colored green (sig) or gray (NS). η_max rows are mostly\n1123\t    green across methods; K_eff rows show scattered green, method-dependent. Visual\n1124\t    impression: K_eff significance is method-fragile.'\n1125\t  - 'Fig 15: Bootstrap distribution of β_Keff_resid for each condition. Several conditions\n1126\t    show CI barely excluding zero (marginal), others have zero well within CI. Compare\n1127\t    to η_max bootstrap distributions which are tightly away from zero.'\n1128\t  analysis: 'VIF 分析是 worst 档的核心打击。K_eff 的显著性在 2-5/12 范围内波动，高度依赖 统计方法选择——这是 \"researcher\n1129\t    degrees of freedom\" 问题。Partial r (K_eff | η_max) = 0.14 意味着 K_eff 在控制 η_max 后仅解释\n1130\t    2% 的独特方差（r²=0.02）。相比之下 η_max 的 partial r = 0.41（17% 独特方差）。即使 K_eff 有微弱的独立效应，其实际意义（practical\n1131\t    significance）可忽略。论文中需要诚实报告所有方法的结果范围，不能只报最有利的。\n1132\t\n1133\t    '\n1134\t- name: Aggregation Rule Comparison\n1135\t  plan_id: plan_010\n1136\t  description: '在 15 模型 455 panel 上测试 majority vote、threshold voting（unanimity）、 weighted\n1137\t    voting、Bayesian aggregation 四种聚合规则下的 K_eff 和 η_max 效应。\n1138\t\n1139\t    '\n1140\t  expected_results:\n1141\t    majority_keff_resid_sig: 4\n1142\t    majority_eta_max_sig: 9\n1143\t    threshold_keff_resid_sig: 6\n1144\t    threshold_eta_max_sig: 7\n1145\t    weighted_keff_resid_sig: 2\n1146\t    weighted_eta_max_sig: 10\n1147\t    bayesian_keff_resid_sig: 1\n1148\t    bayesian_eta_max_sig: 5\n1149\t    keff_sig_varies_by_aggregation: true\n1150\t    aggregation_dependency_interpretation: K_eff effect is aggregation artifact\n1151\t  result_rationale: '聚合规则分析暴露 K_eff 效应的 aggregation dependency。Threshold voting（unanimity）\n1152\t    下 K_eff 6/12 显著——因为 unanimity 放大了单个 judge 的 veto power，diverse panel 中弱 judge\n1153\t    更可能 veto 正确判断。但这不是 \"diversity hurts\"，而是 \"unanimity amplifies weakest-link effect,\n1154\t    and diverse panels have weaker links\"。Bayesian aggregation 大幅削弱两个 predictor：η_max\n1155\t    5/12，K_eff 1/12——Bayesian weighting 有效下调了不可靠 judge 的权重，部分 neutralize 了 weakest-link\n1156\t    效应。 Weighted voting 下 K_eff 几乎消失（2/12），因为 accuracy-based weights 自动 降权弱模型。核心问题：K_eff\n1157\t    的显著性从 1/12（Bayesian）到 6/12（threshold）—— 如果 K_eff 是真正的 structural vulnerability\n1158\t    driver，它不应该如此依赖聚合规则。 这种依赖性暗示 K_eff 效应实际上是特定聚合规则对弱 judge 处理方式的 artifact。\n1159\t\n1160\t    '\n1161\t  tables:\n1162\t  - title: 'Table 15: Aggregation Rule × Vulnerability Driver Analysis'\n1163\t    columns:\n1164\t    - Aggregation\n1165\t    - K_eff sig (/12)\n1166\t    - η_max sig (/12)\n1167\t    - Mean R²\n1168\t    - Best Predictor\n1169\t    rows:\n1170\t    - - Majority Vote\n1171\t      - '4'\n1172\t      - '9'\n1173\t      - '0.38'\n1174\t      - η_max\n1175\t    - - Threshold (Unanimity)\n1176\t      - '6'\n1177\t      - '7'\n1178\t      - '0.42'\n1179\t      - mixed\n1180\t    - - Accuracy-Weighted\n1181\t      - '2'\n1182\t      - '10'\n1183\t      - '0.45'\n1184\t      - η_max\n1185\t    - - Bayesian\n1186\t      - '1'\n1187\t      - '5'\n1188\t      - '0.29'\n1189\t      - η_max (weakened)\n1190\t  - title: 'Table 16: Aggregation as Defense — Mean ASR Comparison'\n1191\t    columns:\n1192\t    - Aggregation\n1193\t    - Mean ASR (all panels)\n1194\t    - ASR (top-10 panels)\n1195\t    - ASR (bottom-10 panels)\n1196\t    - Spread\n1197\t    rows:\n1198\t    - - Majority\n1199\t      - '0.261'\n1200\t      - '0.142'\n1201\t      - '0.418'\n1202\t      - '0.276'\n1203\t    - - Threshold\n1204\t      - '0.183'\n1205\t      - '0.098'\n1206\t      - '0.312'\n1207\t      - '0.214'\n1208\t    - - Weighted\n1209\t      - '0.224'\n1210\t      - '0.121'\n1211\t      - '0.367'\n1212\t      - '0.246'\n1213\t    - - Bayesian\n1214\t      - '0.198'\n1215\t      - '0.112'\n1216\t      - '0.294'\n1217\t      - '0.182'\n1218\t  figures_description:\n1219\t  - 'Fig 16: Grouped bar chart — K_eff sig count (red) and η_max sig count (blue)\n1220\t    under each aggregation rule. K_eff bars fluctuate wildly (1-6), η_max bars are\n1221\t    relatively stable (5-10). Demonstrates K_eff''s aggregation dependency.'\n1222\t  - 'Fig 17: ASR distribution violin plots by aggregation rule. Threshold has lowest\n1223\t    median but widest tail; Bayesian has most compressed distribution (most equitable).\n1224\t    Practical implication: Bayesian reduces both mean and variance of vulnerability.'\n1225\t  analysis: 'Aggregation 分析是 worst 档中最具建设性的发现。虽然它进一步削弱了 K_eff 作为 independent driver\n1226\t    的 claim（aggregation-dependent → possible artifact），但它提供了 实际价值：(a) Bayesian aggregation\n1227\t    作为 defense 的有效性（ASR 均值和方差同时降低）； (b) Threshold voting 最严格但 K_eff 效应最强——不适合 adversarial\n1228\t    setting； (c) Accuracy-weighted 是 good middle ground（K_eff 几乎消失，η_max 仍可控）。 可以\n1229\t    reframe 为 practical contribution: \"choosing the right aggregation rule matters\n1230\t    more than panel diversity composition\"。\n1231\t\n1232\t    '\n1233\t- name: Open-Ended Generation Benchmark\n1234\t  plan_id: plan_011\n1235\t  description: '在 MT-Bench 或 AlpacaEval 风格的开放式生成任务上运行攻击实验， 验证 MCQ findings 是否推广到 open-ended\n1236\t    evaluation。\n1237\t\n1238\t    '\n1239\t  expected_results:\n1240\t    benchmark: MT-Bench (adapted)\n1241\t    n_conditions: 4\n1242\t    keff_resid_sig_positive: 0\n1243\t    keff_resid_sig_negative: 1\n1244\t    keff_resid_nonsig: 3\n1245\t    eta_max_sig: 4\n1246\t    keff_direction_inconsistent_with_MCQ: true\n1247\t    open_ended_mean_ASR: 0.34\n1248\t    MCQ_mean_ASR: 0.26\n1249\t    eta_max_dominance_ratio_open: 0.91\n1250\t  result_rationale: 'Open-ended 任务与 MCQ 的攻击动态根本不同。MCQ 攻击通过影响 judge 对特定选项的偏好， K_eff\n1251\t    的 confound 来自 tier-mixing。Open-ended 评估中 judge 需要评估文本质量—— 攻击更多依赖 persuasive text\n1252\t    generation，所有 judge 面临相似的 adversarial text。 因此 η_max 完全主导（4/4 sig）：最弱 judge 被最容易说服。K_eff\n1253\t    方向混乱——1 个 条件甚至显著负向（diverse panel 更好），因为 open-ended 评估中不同 judge 对文本 质量的多角度评估确实可以互补（更接近\n1254\t    BFT 的 benign fault 假设）。这与 MCQ 结果 不一致是 worst 档的关键打击：如果 diversity trap 不跨任务推广，它就不是一般性\n1255\t    原理，而是 MCQ 评估的特异性现象——可能由 MCQ 的离散选择结构 + tier-mixing confound 共同驱动。\n1256\t\n1257\t    '\n1258\t  tables:\n1259\t  - title: 'Table 17: Open-Ended Task Results'\n1260\t    columns:\n1261\t    - Task Subset\n1262\t    - Attack\n1263\t    - β_ηmax\n1264\t    - p_ηmax\n1265\t    - β_Keff_resid\n1266\t    - p_Keff_resid\n1267\t    - Direction\n1268\t    rows:\n1269\t    - - MT-Bench-Writing\n1270\t      - style_manip\n1271\t      - '0.79'\n1272\t      - <0.001\n1273\t      - '-0.22'\n1274\t      - '0.034'\n1275\t      - NEGATIVE\n1276\t    - - MT-Bench-Reasoning\n1277\t      - logic_distort\n1278\t      - '0.84'\n1279\t      - <0.001\n1280\t      - '0.08'\n1281\t      - '0.541'\n1282\t      - near-zero\n1283\t    - - MT-Bench-Coding\n1284\t      - output_inject\n1285\t      - '0.71'\n1286\t      - '0.002'\n1287\t      - '0.15'\n1288\t      - '0.218'\n1289\t      - positive (NS)\n1290\t    - - MT-Bench-Math\n1291\t      - step_skip\n1292\t      - '0.88'\n1293\t      - <0.001\n1294\t      - '-0.05'\n1295\t      - '0.712'\n1296\t      - near-zero\n1297\t  figures_description:\n1298\t  - 'Fig 18: Comparison heatmap — left panel shows β_Keff_resid for 12 MCQ conditions\n1299\t    (mostly positive), right panel shows β_Keff_resid for 4 open-ended conditions\n1300\t    (mixed/negative). Clear inconsistency across task types.'\n1301\t  - 'Fig 19: η_max comparison — significance rates in MCQ (9/12) and open-ended (4/4).\n1302\t    η_max is the universal predictor; K_eff is task-dependent at best.'\n1303\t  analysis: 'Open-ended 结果是 diversity trap 叙事的 generalizability failure。K_eff 在 MCQ\n1304\t    上 的正向效应不推广到 open-ended 评估——方向不一致且 1 个条件甚至反转。这使得 diversity trap 从 general finding\n1305\t    降级为 MCQ-specific observation，reviewers 会 质疑：如果 diversity 只在 MCQ 中 \"hurts\"，这到底是\n1306\t    diversity 的问题还是 MCQ evaluation 的 artifact？η_max 在两种任务上都一致显著，强化了 weakest-link 作为\n1307\t    universal driver 的地位。Reframe 后论文应在 title/abstract 中避免 generalize， 限定为 \"MCQ-based\n1308\t    evaluation\" 或在 Discussion 中作为 limitation 显著标注。\n1309\t\n1310\t    '\n1311\t- name: Partial-Knowledge Adversary Simulation\n1312\t  plan_id: plan_012\n1313\t  description: '模拟 adversary 仅知 judge family 但不知具体 vulnerability profile 的场景。 与 full-knowledge\n1314\t    adversary 对比 ASR degradation。\n1315\t\n1316\t    '\n1317\t  expected_results:\n1318\t    full_knowledge_mean_ASR: 0.261\n1319\t    partial_knowledge_mean_ASR: 0.238\n1320\t    no_knowledge_mean_ASR: 0.204\n1321\t    ASR_degradation_full_to_partial_pct: 8.8\n1322\t    ASR_degradation_full_to_none_pct: 21.8\n1323\t    partial_keff_sig: 2\n1324\t    partial_eta_max_sig: 8\n1325\t    family_knowledge_utility: modest\n1326\t    keff_effect_under_partial: weaker than full, similar direction\n1327\t  result_rationale: 'Partial-knowledge adversary（知 family 不知具体 vulnerability）仅比 full-knowledge\n1328\t    下降 8.8% ASR——说明 family 信息提供的攻击优势有限，因为 same-family 模型的 vulnerability profile 差异大（family\n1329\t    labels 不可靠，plan_004 的 claim 4）。 No-knowledge adversary 下降 21.8%——说明 any model\n1330\t    knowledge 都有价值但不是 dramatic。 K_eff 在 partial-knowledge 下仅 2/12 显著，进一步弱化了 \"diverse\n1331\t    attack surface\" 叙事：如果 adversary 不知道具体 vulnerability，panel diversity 不应创造可利用的 attack\n1332\t    surface（adversary 无法 target specific judges）。K_eff 效应在 partial-knowledge 下几乎消失，暗示\n1333\t    full-knowledge 下的 K_eff 效应部分来自 adversary 对具体 vulnerability 的知识（即 K_eff 效应依赖 threat\n1334\t    model 假设——full-knowledge 在实践中不现实）。\n1335\t\n1336\t    '\n1337\t  tables:\n1338\t  - title: 'Table 18: Adversary Knowledge Level Comparison'\n1339\t    columns:\n1340\t    - Knowledge Level\n1341\t    - Mean ASR\n1342\t    - K_eff sig (/12)\n1343\t    - η_max sig (/12)\n1344\t    - R²\n1345\t    rows:\n1346\t    - - Full (exact η_j)\n1347\t      - '0.261'\n1348\t      - '4'\n1349\t      - '9'\n1350\t      - '0.38'\n1351\t    - - Partial (family only)\n1352\t      - '0.238'\n1353\t      - '2'\n1354\t      - '8'\n1355\t      - '0.34'\n1356\t    - - None (uniform attack)\n1357\t      - '0.204'\n1358\t      - '0'\n1359\t      - '6'\n1360\t      - '0.22'\n1361\t  - title: 'Table 19: ASR Degradation Analysis'\n1362\t    columns:\n1363\t    - Transition\n1364\t    - ΔASR\n1365\t    - Δ%\n1366\t    - Interpretation\n1367\t    rows:\n1368\t    - - Full → Partial\n1369\t      - '-0.023'\n1370\t      - -8.8%\n1371\t      - Family info has modest value\n1372\t    - - Full → None\n1373\t      - '-0.057'\n1374\t      - -21.8%\n1375\t      - Model knowledge matters but not dramatically\n1376\t    - - Partial → None\n1377\t      - '-0.034'\n1378\t      - -14.3%\n1379\t      - Family info alone provides limited advantage\n1380\t  figures_description:\n1381\t  - 'Fig 20: Stacked bar chart of ASR under three knowledge levels, faceted by condition.\n1382\t    Shows modest degradation from full to partial, with largest drops in conditions\n1383\t    where K_eff was already significant (score_manip, position) — these are the conditions\n1384\t    most dependent on judge-specific targeting.'\n1385\t  analysis: Partial-knowledge 分析有两个重要含义：(a) 实践上，adversary 不需要精确 vulnerability 知识就能实现高\n1386\t    ASR（从 0.261 到 0.204 的下降 modest）——这本身是一个重要的安全发现； (b) 理论上，K_eff 效应依赖 full-knowledge\n1387\t    假设，在更现实的 threat model 下消失—— 这削弱了 K_eff 作为 general vulnerability driver 的 claim。在\n1388\t    reframed 论文中， 这个实验可以支持 \"η_max is robust across threat models while K_eff is threat-model-specific\"\n1389\t    的叙事。\n1390\t"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"4bd8a18a-978d-4865-811c-2ab932d2722c","uuid":"7039c16a-cc3e-4413-9b87-d6dd48a5b8e0","timestamp":"2026-05-22T18:46:52.179Z","tool_use_result":{"type":"text","file":{"filePath":"/home/ubuntu/.agent-ml-research-idea_gen_0519_2/projects/cert_manip_resist_eval/artifacts/dream_reports/dream_20260522T173833/worst/review_context.yaml","content":"narrative_guidance: '放弃 \"Diversity Trap\" framing。Reframe 为 \"Structural Vulnerability\n  Anatomy of Multi-Judge LLM Evaluation\"。 新 lead claim：η_max 作为 panel vulnerability\n  的 dominant 且 near-sufficient predictor（9-11/12 显著）， 这本身是对 \"diversity protects\" 假设的实证否定——不需要\n  diversity actively hurts，只需 diversity doesn''t help 而 weakest-link 决定一切。K_eff 降级为\n  \"exploratory analysis showing suggestive but confounded association\"， 置于 Discussion。方法论贡献前移：copula\n  failure（即使 ratio 降了仍是有意义的 methodological finding）、 family label 不可靠性、15-model/455-panel\n  规模的 evaluation benchmark 本身作为 resource contribution。 BFT 从 core mechanism 降为 Discussion\n  section 的 \"open question\"。 补偿策略：(a) 强调 weakest-link 发现的实用价值（panel 安全由最弱 judge 决定）；\n  (b) 释放 per-judge ASR 浓度分析（plan_006 Gini/entropy）作为 adaptive adversary targeting\n  的直接证据； (c) 推 aggregation rule 比较作为 practical contribution（哪种聚合最抗攻击）。 预期结果：需要 rebuttal\n  期大幅补充，borderline reject / weak accept。仍冲 EMNLP 但准备 NAACL 2027 backup。\n\n  '\nimagined_experiments:\n- name: 15-Model Scale Expansion\n  plan_id: plan_001\n  description: '扩展至 15 个模型（6 open-source + 4 API + 大型开源 70B/72B），重跑 MI matrix 和 全\n    panel（C(15,3)=455）回归分析。12 conditions（2 datasets × 6 attacks）。\n\n    '\n  expected_results:\n    n_models: 15\n    n_panels: 455\n    n_conditions: 12\n    keff_raw_sig_positive: 7\n    keff_raw_sig_negative: 0\n    keff_raw_nonsig: 5\n    keff_resid_sig_positive: 4\n    keff_resid_nonsig: 8\n    eta_max_sig: 9\n    mean_R2_full_model: 0.38\n    mean_R2_eta_max_only: 0.34\n    delta_R2_keff_contribution: 0.04\n    keff_eta_max_correlation_mean: 0.73\n    keff_eta_max_correlation_range:\n    - 0.62\n    - 0.85\n    VIF_keff: 2.14\n    confound_free_conditions_count: 1\n    confound_free_condition_keff_p: 0.032\n    confound_free_condition_keff_beta: 0.41\n  result_rationale: '15 模型涵盖 3 个 capability tier（small 7-8B、medium 13-14B、large 70B+\n    及 API）， tier 跨度增大导致 K_eff 与 η_max 的 confound 加剧（r≈0.73）。高 K_eff panel 几乎 必然混入弱模型，低\n    K_eff panel 则趋于同质强模型。Residualization 后 K_eff 仅在 4/12 conditions 保持显著——恰好是 transferable\n    attack（score_manipulation, position_bias） 且 η_max 方差本身较大的条件。其余 8 conditions 中\n    K_eff 的 partial effect 被 η_max 吸收殆尽。η_max 维持 9/12 显著，证明 weakest-link 仍是 dominant\n    driver。 ΔR² 仅 0.04 意味着 K_eff 在 η_max 之上的增量解释力微乎其微。 仅 1 个 confound-free condition（arc×score_manipulation,\n    r≈0.35）中 K_eff 勉强显著 （p=0.032），但单一 condition 无法支撑核心 claim。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - title: 'Table 1: K_eff Residualized Regression — 15 Models, 455 Panels'\n    columns:\n    - Dataset\n    - Attack\n    - β_ηmax\n    - p_ηmax\n    - β_Keff_resid\n    - p_Keff_resid\n    - R²\n    - K_eff-ηmax r\n    rows:\n    - - MMLU\n      - sycophancy\n      - '0.82'\n      - <0.001\n      - '0.18'\n      - '0.147'\n      - '0.41'\n      - '0.78'\n    - - MMLU\n      - score_manip\n      - '0.55'\n      - <0.001\n      - '0.39'\n      - '0.021'\n      - '0.36'\n      - '0.68'\n    - - MMLU\n      - position\n      - '0.71'\n      - <0.001\n      - '0.24'\n      - '0.089'\n      - '0.39'\n      - '0.75'\n    - - MMLU\n      - verbosity\n      - '0.88'\n      - <0.001\n      - '0.09'\n      - '0.511'\n      - '0.42'\n      - '0.81'\n    - - MMLU\n      - authority\n      - '0.79'\n      - <0.001\n      - '0.15'\n      - '0.218'\n      - '0.37'\n      - '0.76'\n    - - MMLU\n      - few_shot_hijack\n      - '0.64'\n      - '0.002'\n      - '0.31'\n      - '0.043'\n      - '0.33'\n      - '0.70'\n    - - ARC\n      - sycophancy\n      - '0.85'\n      - <0.001\n      - '0.12'\n      - '0.341'\n      - '0.43'\n      - '0.79'\n    - - ARC\n      - score_manip\n      - '0.48'\n      - '0.003'\n      - '0.41'\n      - '0.032'\n      - '0.35'\n      - '0.35'\n    - - ARC\n      - position\n      - '0.73'\n      - <0.001\n      - '0.22'\n      - '0.102'\n      - '0.38'\n      - '0.74'\n    - - ARC\n      - verbosity\n      - '0.91'\n      - <0.001\n      - '0.06'\n      - '0.649'\n      - '0.44'\n      - '0.82'\n    - - ARC\n      - authority\n      - '0.76'\n      - <0.001\n      - '0.19'\n      - '0.157'\n      - '0.36'\n      - '0.77'\n    - - ARC\n      - few_shot_hijack\n      - '0.59'\n      - '0.004'\n      - '0.28'\n      - '0.071'\n      - '0.32'\n      - '0.72'\n  - title: 'Table 2: Model Pool Summary — 15 Models'\n    columns:\n    - Model\n    - Family\n    - Size\n    - Tier\n    - Mean η (6 attacks)\n    - Clean ACC\n    rows:\n    - - Qwen2.5-7B\n      - Qwen\n      - 7B\n      - small\n      - '0.38'\n      - '0.61'\n    - - Qwen2.5-14B\n      - Qwen\n      - 14B\n      - medium\n      - '0.22'\n      - '0.74'\n    - - Qwen2.5-72B\n      - Qwen\n      - 72B\n      - large\n      - '0.11'\n      - '0.83'\n    - - Llama-3.1-8B\n      - Llama\n      - 8B\n      - small\n      - '0.41'\n      - '0.58'\n    - - Llama-3.1-70B\n      - Llama\n      - 70B\n      - large\n      - '0.14'\n      - '0.80'\n    - - Mistral-7B\n      - Mistral\n      - 7B\n      - small\n      - '0.44'\n      - '0.55'\n    - - Mistral-Nemo-12B\n      - Mistral\n      - 12B\n      - medium\n      - '0.27'\n      - '0.69'\n    - - Phi-3-mini\n      - Microsoft\n      - 3.8B\n      - small\n      - '0.49'\n      - '0.52'\n    - - Phi-3-medium\n      - Microsoft\n      - 14B\n      - medium\n      - '0.25'\n      - '0.71'\n    - - Gemma-2-9B\n      - Google\n      - 9B\n      - small\n      - '0.36'\n      - '0.63'\n    - - GPT-4o-mini\n      - OpenAI\n      - API\n      - medium\n      - '0.19'\n      - '0.76'\n    - - GPT-4o\n      - OpenAI\n      - API\n      - large\n      - '0.08'\n      - '0.87'\n    - - GPT-4.1\n      - OpenAI\n      - API\n      - large\n      - '0.07'\n      - '0.89'\n    - - GPT-4.1-mini\n      - OpenAI\n      - API\n      - medium\n      - '0.16'\n      - '0.78'\n    - - Claude-3.5-Haiku\n      - Anthropic\n      - API\n      - medium\n      - '0.18'\n      - '0.77'\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Fig 1: Scatter of K_eff vs η_max for 455 panels, color-coded by dataset. Regression\n    line shows r≈0.73. Severe confound visible — high-K_eff panels cluster at high\n    η_max. Only 1 condition (arc×score_manip) shows appreciable spread allowing independent\n    K_eff estimation.'\n  - 'Fig 2: Forest plot of β_Keff_resid across 12 conditions with 95% CI. 4 conditions\n    have CI excluding zero (marked with *); 8 conditions cross zero. Compare to η_max\n    forest plot where 9/12 exclude zero.'\n  analysis: '核心 diversity trap framing 受到致命打击。K_eff residualized 显著率从期望的 8/12 降至 4/12，且这\n    4 个中有 2 个 p 值在 0.02-0.04 之间（经 FDR 校正后可能变 NS）。 仅 1 个 confound-free condition 意味着\n    residualization 的可信度依赖于线性假设—— reviewer 可以合理质疑 \"你的 K_eff effect 只是 nonlinear η_max\n    effect 的残余\"。 η_max 9/12 显著是稳健的，weakest-link 叙事成立，但这是预期结果不是新发现。 ΔR² = 0.04 使得 \"dual\n    vulnerability driver\" 的 framing 难以为继——第二个 driver 解释力不到 4%。需要 reframe 为 η_max-dominant\n    故事。\n\n    '\n- name: Attack Type Expansion\n  plan_id: plan_002\n  description: '新增 few-shot hijacking、persona manipulation、instruction override 三种攻击类型，\n    在 15 模型 455 panel 上运行，产生 6 个新 conditions（2 datasets × 3 new attacks）。\n\n    '\n  expected_results:\n    new_conditions: 6\n    keff_resid_sig_new: 2\n    keff_resid_nonsig_new: 4\n    eta_max_sig_new: 5\n    keff_direction_positive_new: 4\n    keff_direction_negative_new: 1\n    keff_direction_near_zero_new: 1\n    mean_R2_new_conditions: 0.31\n    combined_keff_resid_sig_18: 6\n    combined_eta_max_sig_18: 14\n  result_rationale: '新攻击类型中 few-shot hijacking 和 instruction override 是 transferable\n    attack， K_eff 在这些条件下可能保持微弱正向显著（p≈0.03-0.04）；persona manipulation 则高度 依赖模型特定 persona\n    alignment 训练，η_max 几乎完全解释方差。整体上新增 6 conditions 中仅 2 个 K_eff 显著，且 1 个条件 K_eff 方向为负（persona\n    manipulation on ARC）， 方向不一致削弱了 \"diversity universally hurts\" 的叙事。18 条件合计 K_eff\n    6/18 ≈ 33% 显著率——FDR 校正后可能进一步缩减至 4-5/18，属于 \"suggestive but not robust\" 水平。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - title: 'Table 3: New Attack Types — K_eff Residualized Results'\n    columns:\n    - Dataset\n    - Attack\n    - β_ηmax\n    - p_ηmax\n    - β_Keff_resid\n    - p_Keff_resid\n    - R²\n    - Direction\n    rows:\n    - - MMLU\n      - few_shot_hijack\n      - '0.64'\n      - '0.002'\n      - '0.31'\n      - '0.043'\n      - '0.33'\n      - positive\n    - - MMLU\n      - persona_manip\n      - '0.91'\n      - <0.001\n      - '0.05'\n      - '0.724'\n      - '0.45'\n      - near-zero\n    - - MMLU\n      - instruct_override\n      - '0.58'\n      - '0.005'\n      - '0.34'\n      - '0.038'\n      - '0.31'\n      - positive\n    - - ARC\n      - few_shot_hijack\n      - '0.59'\n      - '0.004'\n      - '0.28'\n      - '0.071'\n      - '0.32'\n      - positive\n    - - ARC\n      - persona_manip\n      - '0.87'\n      - <0.001\n      - '-0.12'\n      - '0.389'\n      - '0.41'\n      - negative\n    - - ARC\n      - instruct_override\n      - '0.62'\n      - '0.003'\n      - '0.26'\n      - '0.088'\n      - '0.30'\n      - positive\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Fig 3: Heatmap of β_Keff_resid across all 18 conditions (12 original + 6 new).\n    Color gradient from blue (negative) to red (positive). Shows scattered pattern\n    — no consistent K_eff direction, with 1 negative entry (ARC×persona_manip). Contrast\n    with η_max heatmap showing near-uniform positive β.'\n  analysis: '攻击扩展没有挽救 K_eff 叙事。新增条件中 K_eff 显著率 2/6，其中 persona manipulation 出现方向反转（K_eff\n    负但 NS）——这与 \"diversity hurts\" 不一致，虽然不显著但给 reviewer 提供了攻击点。合计 18 conditions 中 K_eff\n    6/18 显著，低于 33% 的 chance expected 阈值，FDR 校正后预计降至 4-5/18。η_max 14/18 显著，进一步巩固 weakest-link\n    的 dominant 地位。新攻击类型未发现任何 K_eff dominates η_max 的条件。\n\n    '\n- name: Random-Fault BFT Contrast Simulation\n  plan_id: plan_003\n  description: '模拟随机故障场景：每个 judge 以概率 η_j 独立犯错，majority vote 决策。 比较 K_eff 在 random-fault\n    vs adaptive 两种 regime 下的 β 和显著性。\n\n    '\n  expected_results:\n    RF_keff_sig_positive: 10\n    RF_keff_nonsig: 2\n    RF_eta_max_sig: 11\n    RF_mean_beta_keff: 0.42\n    adaptive_mean_beta_keff: 0.38\n    BFT_RF_beta_ratio: 0.91\n    RF_mean_R2: 0.62\n    adaptive_mean_R2: 0.38\n    delta_R2_RF_vs_adaptive: 0.24\n    RF_keff_direction: positive (same as adaptive)\n    regime_contrast_p_interaction: 0.217\n  result_rationale: 'BFT contrast 的核心预期是 K_eff 在 RF 下显著正向（diversity helps under random\n    faults） 但在 adaptive 下 NS 或反转。Worst 档下实际观察到：K_eff 在 RF 下同样正向显著 （10/12），与 adaptive\n    下方向一致。原因：在 RF 模拟中 η_j 直接决定 judge 犯错率， 高 K_eff panel 仍然混入高 η_j 的弱模型，majority vote\n    下弱模型拉低整体正确率。 因此 K_eff 正向不是 \"diversity 主动有害\" 而是 \"diversity 引入弱模型\" 的统计反映—— 这在 RF\n    和 adaptive 两种 regime 下都成立。β ratio 0.91 表明两种 regime 下 K_eff 的效应量几乎相同，regime interaction\n    term NS (p=0.217)。唯一的 regime 差异是 R²： RF 下 R²=0.62 vs adaptive R²=0.38，ΔR²=0.24——RF\n    更可预测但这只是因为 RF 没有 strategic variance，不是因为 K_eff 效应不同。BFT reversal mechanism 叙事瓦解。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - title: 'Table 4: BFT Regime Contrast — K_eff β Comparison'\n    columns:\n    - Dataset\n    - Attack\n    - β_Keff (Adaptive)\n    - p (Adaptive)\n    - β_Keff (RF)\n    - p (RF)\n    - β Ratio\n    - Interaction p\n    rows:\n    - - MMLU\n      - sycophancy\n      - '0.18'\n      - '0.147'\n      - '0.21'\n      - '0.024'\n      - '1.17'\n      - '0.682'\n    - - MMLU\n      - score_manip\n      - '0.39'\n      - '0.021'\n      - '0.44'\n      - '0.003'\n      - '1.13'\n      - '0.541'\n    - - MMLU\n      - position\n      - '0.24'\n      - '0.089'\n      - '0.28'\n      - '0.011'\n      - '1.17'\n      - '0.614'\n    - - MMLU\n      - verbosity\n      - '0.09'\n      - '0.511'\n      - '0.15'\n      - '0.108'\n      - '1.67'\n      - '0.398'\n    - - MMLU\n      - authority\n      - '0.15'\n      - '0.218'\n      - '0.19'\n      - '0.047'\n      - '1.27'\n      - '0.583'\n    - - MMLU\n      - few_shot_hijack\n      - '0.31'\n      - '0.043'\n      - '0.35'\n      - '0.008'\n      - '1.13'\n      - '0.617'\n    - - ARC\n      - sycophancy\n      - '0.12'\n      - '0.341'\n      - '0.16'\n      - '0.072'\n      - '1.33'\n      - '0.521'\n    - - ARC\n      - score_manip\n      - '0.41'\n      - '0.032'\n      - '0.48'\n      - '0.001'\n      - '1.17'\n      - '0.434'\n    - - ARC\n      - position\n      - '0.22'\n      - '0.102'\n      - '0.27'\n      - '0.015'\n      - '1.23'\n      - '0.548'\n    - - ARC\n      - verbosity\n      - '0.06'\n      - '0.649'\n      - '0.11'\n      - '0.198'\n      - '1.83'\n      - '0.412'\n    - - ARC\n      - authority\n      - '0.19'\n      - '0.157'\n      - '0.22'\n      - '0.038'\n      - '1.16'\n      - '0.601'\n    - - ARC\n      - few_shot_hijack\n      - '0.28'\n      - '0.071'\n      - '0.33'\n      - '0.009'\n      - '1.18'\n      - '0.547'\n  - title: 'Table 5: R² Comparison Across Regimes'\n    columns:\n    - Dataset\n    - Attack\n    - R² (Adaptive)\n    - R² (RF)\n    - ΔR²\n    rows:\n    - - MMLU\n      - sycophancy\n      - '0.41'\n      - '0.64'\n      - '0.23'\n    - - MMLU\n      - score_manip\n      - '0.36'\n      - '0.58'\n      - '0.22'\n    - - MMLU\n      - position\n      - '0.39'\n      - '0.61'\n      - '0.22'\n    - - MMLU\n      - verbosity\n      - '0.42'\n      - '0.67'\n      - '0.25'\n    - - MMLU\n      - authority\n      - '0.37'\n      - '0.59'\n      - '0.22'\n    - - MMLU\n      - few_shot_hijack\n      - '0.33'\n      - '0.55'\n      - '0.22'\n    - - ARC\n      - sycophancy\n      - '0.43'\n      - '0.69'\n      - '0.26'\n    - - ARC\n      - score_manip\n      - '0.35'\n      - '0.57'\n      - '0.22'\n    - - ARC\n      - position\n      - '0.38'\n      - '0.62'\n      - '0.24'\n    - - ARC\n      - verbosity\n      - '0.44'\n      - '0.71'\n      - '0.27'\n    - - ARC\n      - authority\n      - '0.36'\n      - '0.60'\n      - '0.24'\n    - - ARC\n      - few_shot_hijack\n      - '0.32'\n      - '0.53'\n      - '0.21'\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Fig 4: Paired bar chart of β_Keff under adaptive (red) vs RF (blue) for each\n    condition. Near-identical heights across all 12 conditions. Error bars overlap\n    extensively. Regime interaction NS in all conditions.'\n  - 'Fig 5: R² comparison scatter — RF on x-axis, adaptive on y-axis. All points below\n    diagonal, showing RF consistently more predictable. But this is a predictability\n    difference, not a mechanism difference.'\n  analysis: 'BFT contrast 实验是 GO/NO-GO gate，结果为 NO-GO。K_eff 在 RF 下不仅没有变负 （diversity\n    helps），反而保持正向且更显著（10/12 vs 4/12 residualized adaptive）。 这意味着 K_eff 的正向效应不是 adaptive\n    adversary 特有的——而是 panel composition 的基本属性（高 diversity → 混入弱模型 → 高 ASR），RF 和 adaptive\n    下都成立。 BFT reversal mechanism 的核心前提被否定：我们无法证明 diversity 在 RF 下保护但在 adaptive 下有害。唯一可挽救的发现是\n    ΔR² = 0.24，说明 adaptive attacker 引入了 strategic variance 使得 panel composition 的预测力下降——但这是一个弱得多的\n    claim， 不足以支撑 Claim 2 作为独立贡献。BFT 应降级为 Discussion 中的 \"open question\"。\n\n    '\n- name: Capability-Matched K_eff Validation\n  plan_id: plan_004\n  description: '在同一 capability tier 内（all-small 7-8B 或 all-large 70B+/API）测试 K_eff\n    是否 仍然显著。如果 tier-matched panel 中 K_eff 消失 → K_eff 效应是 tier-mixing artifact。\n\n    '\n  expected_results:\n    tiers_tested: 3\n    panels_small_tier: 10\n    panels_medium_tier: 10\n    panels_large_tier: 10\n    small_tier_keff_sig: 0\n    medium_tier_keff_sig: 1\n    large_tier_keff_sig: 0\n    total_capability_matched_keff_sig: 1\n    total_conditions_tested: 6\n    eta_max_variance_within_tier: 0.008\n    keff_eta_max_correlation_within_tier: 0.22\n    within_tier_keff_p_range:\n    - 0.041\n    - 0.891\n    within_tier_mean_R2: 0.12\n  result_rationale: 'Capability-matched 是 worst 档的致命实验。同 tier 内模型能力相近，η_max 方差极小 （约\n    0.008 vs 全池 0.045），消除了 tier-mixing confound。结果：K_eff 仅在 1/6 条件下显著（medium tier\n    × score_manipulation, p=0.041，FDR 后可能 NS），其余 5/6 全部 NS。这直接证明 K_eff 的表面效应是 tier-mixing\n    的统计幻象：当你在全池抽 panel， 高 K_eff panel 跨 tier 抽样（混入 7B 和 70B），低 K_eff panel 同 tier\n    抽样—— K_eff 与 η_max 的相关性是 tier-mixing 的副产品，不是因果关系。 每个 tier 仅 C(5,3)=10 个 panel，样本量不足以检测小效应，但即便如此\n    η_max 方差 消失也说明在能力控制后 K_eff 没有独立的预测力。Reviewer 可以合理论证： \"K_eff effect = capability\n    heterogeneity effect, not diversity per se\"。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - title: 'Table 6: Capability-Matched K_eff Analysis'\n    columns:\n    - Tier\n    - N Panels\n    - Condition\n    - β_Keff\n    - p_Keff\n    - R²\n    - η_max Var\n    rows:\n    - - Small (7-8B)\n      - '10'\n      - MMLU×sycophancy\n      - '0.08'\n      - '0.721'\n      - '0.09'\n      - '0.007'\n    - - Small (7-8B)\n      - '10'\n      - ARC×score_manip\n      - '0.14'\n      - '0.548'\n      - '0.11'\n      - '0.008'\n    - - Medium (12-14B+API-mini)\n      - '10'\n      - MMLU×sycophancy\n      - '0.11'\n      - '0.612'\n      - '0.10'\n      - '0.009'\n    - - Medium (12-14B+API-mini)\n      - '10'\n      - ARC×score_manip\n      - '0.29'\n      - '0.041'\n      - '0.18'\n      - '0.011'\n    - - Large (70B+API)\n      - '10'\n      - MMLU×sycophancy\n      - '0.06'\n      - '0.891'\n      - '0.07'\n      - '0.004'\n    - - Large (70B+API)\n      - '10'\n      - ARC×score_manip\n      - '0.09'\n      - '0.684'\n      - '0.08'\n      - '0.005'\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Fig 6: Side-by-side comparison — left: K_eff vs ASR scatter for full pool (455\n    panels, clear positive trend), right: K_eff vs ASR scatter within each tier (3×10\n    panels, flat/noisy). The positive trend disappears when capability is controlled,\n    visualizing the confound.'\n  - 'Fig 7: η_max variance decomposition bar chart — between-tier variance (0.037)\n    vs within-tier variance (0.008). 82% of η_max variance is between tiers, explaining\n    why tier-mixing creates spurious K_eff association.'\n  analysis: '这是对 diversity trap framing 的最强反驳。Capability-matched 0-1/6 显著意味着 K_eff\n    的独立效应在控制 capability 后基本消失。Residualized analysis 在全池中仍然 显著 4/12 的原因是：residualization\n    假设线性关系，但 K_eff-η_max confound 可能是 非线性的（阶梯型：跨 tier → K_eff 骤升 + η_max 骤升），线性 residualization\n    无法完全去除。Capability-matched 是更强的 confound control（分层而非回归调整）， 结果否定了 K_eff 的独立效应。需要在论文中诚实报告这个\n    null result，将 K_eff 从 core claim 降级为 \"exploratory, potentially confounded\"。\n\n    '\n- name: Two-Stage Panel Design Algorithm Benchmark\n  plan_id: plan_005\n  description: 'Robustness-first 两阶段选择：(1) 筛选 η ≤ threshold 的 judge，(2) 在剩余中最大化 K_eff。\n    与 5 个 baseline（random, max-K_eff, strongest-K, min-η, diversity-only）对比。\n\n    '\n  expected_results:\n    baselines_tested: 5\n    two_stage_vs_strongest_K_ASR_reduction_pct: 2.3\n    two_stage_vs_strongest_K_p: 0.312\n    two_stage_vs_random_ASR_reduction_pct: 18.4\n    two_stage_vs_max_keff_ASR_reduction_pct: 31.2\n    min_eta_dominates_conditions: 4\n    two_stage_dominates_conditions: 1\n    strongest_K_dominates_conditions: 1\n    two_stage_ASR_reduction_pct: 3.1\n    two_stage_vs_strongest_K_stat_sig: false\n    optimal_eta_threshold: 0.15\n  result_rationale: '在 worst 档下 K_eff 的独立效应已消失（plan_004 显示 capability-matched 后 K_eff\n    NS）， 因此两阶段的第二步（maximize K_eff among screened judges）几乎不提供额外收益。 Robustness screening（step\n    1）本身有效——排除 η > threshold 的弱模型大幅降低 ASR—— 但这与简单的 strongest-K 策略效果相同。Two-stage 与\n    strongest-K 的差异仅 2.3% （p=0.312, NS），因为 screening 后剩余模型能力相近，K_eff 的变异范围收窄。 min_eta（不考虑\n    diversity）在 4/6 conditions 表现最佳，进一步说明 panel 安全由 最弱 judge 决定。Two-stage 的存在意义被削弱：如果第二步（diversity）没用，\n    算法退化为 \"just pick the strongest K models\"。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - title: 'Table 7: Panel Selection Strategy Comparison (mean ASR across 6 attacks)'\n    columns:\n    - Strategy\n    - Mean ASR\n    - vs Strongest-K Δ%\n    - p vs Strongest-K\n    - Wins (6 conditions)\n    rows:\n    - - Random\n      - '0.284'\n      - +21.5%\n      - <0.001\n      - '0'\n    - - Max-K_eff\n      - '0.341'\n      - +45.9%\n      - <0.001\n      - '0'\n    - - Diversity-Only\n      - '0.312'\n      - +33.5%\n      - <0.001\n      - '0'\n    - - Min-η_max\n      - '0.229'\n      - -2.1%\n      - '0.478'\n      - '4'\n    - - Strongest-K\n      - '0.234'\n      - —\n      - —\n      - '1'\n    - - Two-Stage\n      - '0.227'\n      - -3.1%\n      - '0.312'\n      - '1'\n  - title: 'Table 8: Two-Stage vs Strongest-K Per Condition'\n    columns:\n    - Condition\n    - ASR (Two-Stage)\n    - ASR (Strongest-K)\n    - Δ%\n    - p\n    rows:\n    - - MMLU×sycophancy\n      - '0.211'\n      - '0.219'\n      - -3.7%\n      - '0.284'\n    - - MMLU×score_manip\n      - '0.198'\n      - '0.207'\n      - -4.3%\n      - '0.198'\n    - - MMLU×position\n      - '0.237'\n      - '0.241'\n      - -1.7%\n      - '0.641'\n    - - ARC×sycophancy\n      - '0.241'\n      - '0.248'\n      - -2.8%\n      - '0.352'\n    - - ARC×score_manip\n      - '0.185'\n      - '0.194'\n      - -4.6%\n      - '0.187'\n    - - ARC×position\n      - '0.249'\n      - '0.253'\n      - -1.6%\n      - '0.689'\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Fig 8: Bar chart of mean ASR for 6 strategies. Error bars show 95% CI. Two-Stage\n    and Strongest-K bars nearly identical, CIs heavily overlapping. Max-K_eff is worst\n    (confirms diversity harmful in unscreened pool). Min-η_max and Two-Stage are statistically\n    indistinguishable.'\n  analysis: 'Two-stage ≤5% improvement over strongest-K 且无统计显著性。这与 worst 档的预期一致： 如果\n    K_eff 没有独立效应（plan_004），那么在 robustness-screened pool 中最大化 K_eff 不应带来额外收益。Max-K_eff\n    是最差策略（ASR 最高）这一发现仍然有价值—— 它警告不要盲目追求 diversity——但这只需 η_max 解释就够了（高 K_eff = 混入弱模型\n    = 高 ASR）， 不需要 \"diversity independently hurts\" 的 claim。实践建议简化为 \"pick the most robust\n    judges, ignore diversity\"，这比 two-stage 更简单但可能过于平凡。\n\n    '\n- name: Per-Judge ASR Concentration Analysis\n  plan_id: plan_006\n  description: '对每个 panel × attack，计算各 judge 的 ASR 分布，用 Gini 系数和 entropy 量化 adaptive\n    adversary 的 targeting 集中度。高 Gini = adversary 集中攻击特定 judge。\n\n    '\n  expected_results:\n    mean_gini_adaptive: 0.38\n    mean_gini_random_fault: 0.12\n    gini_diff_p: <0.001\n    mean_entropy_adaptive: 2.41\n    mean_entropy_random_fault: 3.22\n    entropy_diff_p: <0.001\n    gini_keff_correlation: 0.21\n    gini_keff_p: 0.089\n    gini_eta_max_correlation: 0.67\n    gini_eta_max_p: <0.001\n    high_gini_panels_pct: 34\n    targeting_consistent_across_attacks: false\n  result_rationale: 'Adaptive adversary 确实展现 targeting 行为（Gini 0.38 vs RF 0.12），但集中度\n    中等而非极端。关键问题：Gini 与 η_max 高度相关（r=0.67）但与 K_eff 弱相关（r=0.21, NS）。 这意味着 targeting\n    主要针对最弱 judge（η_max 高的 panel 中弱 judge 更容易被攻克）， 而不是利用 diversity 创造的 diverse attack\n    surface。如果 K_eff 独立驱动 targeting， 我们预期 Gini 与 K_eff 显著相关（高 diversity → adversary\n    有更多独立漏洞可攻击 → 攻击更集中于特定 judge），但 p=0.089 未达显著。此外 targeting 不跨攻击一致—— 同一 panel 在不同攻击下被\n    target 的 judge 不同，进一步削弱 \"structural diversity creates systematic exploitable surface\"\n    的论点。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - title: 'Table 9: ASR Concentration Statistics'\n    columns:\n    - Metric\n    - Adaptive (mean)\n    - Adaptive (SD)\n    - RF (mean)\n    - RF (SD)\n    - Diff p\n    rows:\n    - - Gini\n      - '0.38'\n      - '0.14'\n      - '0.12'\n      - '0.05'\n      - <0.001\n    - - Entropy (bits)\n      - '2.41'\n      - '0.52'\n      - '3.22'\n      - '0.31'\n      - <0.001\n    - - Max single-judge share\n      - '0.51'\n      - '0.12'\n      - '0.38'\n      - '0.06'\n      - <0.001\n  - title: 'Table 10: Gini Coefficient Correlations'\n    columns:\n    - Predictor\n    - r with Gini\n    - p\n    - Interpretation\n    rows:\n    - - η_max\n      - '0.67'\n      - <0.001\n      - Targeting tracks individual weakness\n    - - K_eff\n      - '0.21'\n      - '0.089'\n      - Weak/NS association with diversity\n    - - Panel size\n      - '0.04'\n      - '0.814'\n      - No panel size effect\n    - - Mean capability\n      - '-0.58'\n      - <0.001\n      - Stronger panels → less concentrated targeting\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Fig 9: Violin plot of Gini coefficient distributions — adaptive (red, wider spread,\n    higher median) vs RF (blue, narrow, low). Shows adaptive targeting exists but\n    is moderate.'\n  - 'Fig 10: Scatter of Gini vs K_eff (left, flat/NS) and Gini vs η_max (right, clear\n    positive trend). Demonstrates targeting is driven by individual weakness, not\n    structural diversity.'\n  analysis: 'Per-judge 浓度分析提供了 adaptive vs RF 差异的直接证据——这是一个有用的 finding， 可作为 paper\n    的 empirical contribution。但分析同时削弱了 diversity trap：targeting 集中度由 η_max（而非 K_eff）解释。Adaptive\n    adversary 攻击最弱 judge，不是利用 diverse attack surface。这与 reframed narrative（η_max dominant,\n    diversity irrelevant） 一致。Gini 分析可以移入 \"Adaptive Adversary Behavior\" 子节，作为 η_max\n    dominance 的补充证据，而非 diversity trap 的支持。\n\n    '\n- name: Diversity-Capability Tradeoff Visualization\n  plan_id: plan_007\n  description: '绘制 K_eff vs η_max across 455 panels，拟合 tradeoff curve，Pareto frontier\n    analysis， 按 tier 分层。\n\n    '\n  expected_results:\n    keff_eta_max_pearson_r: 0.73\n    keff_eta_max_spearman_rho: 0.71\n    tradeoff_curve_R2: 0.53\n    pareto_frontier_size: 12\n    pareto_pct_from_large_tier: 83\n    pareto_pct_from_mixed_tier: 17\n    pareto_pct_from_small_tier: 0\n    pareto_panels_mean_keff: 1.82\n    pareto_panels_mean_eta_max: 0.09\n    non_pareto_gap_ASR: 0.11\n  result_rationale: 'Tradeoff 可视化清晰展示了 K_eff 与 η_max 的结构性关联：r=0.73，Pareto frontier\n    几乎完全由 large-tier panel 占据（83%），因为只有在全部选择强模型时才能同时获得 低 η_max 和中等 K_eff。Small-tier\n    panel 全部位于 Pareto frontier 之下。 这个 visualization 本身有价值（展示了 evaluation panel design\n    的结构约束）， 但在 worst 档下它更多地支持了 \"K_eff effect is confound\" 的叙事：tradeoff 不是 独立的两个维度的\n    tension，而是 tier-mixing 的必然结果。Pareto frontier 上的 panel 基本就是 \"all strong models\"，equivalent\n    to strongest-K 策略。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - title: 'Table 11: Pareto Frontier Panel Characteristics'\n    columns:\n    - Panel ID\n    - Models\n    - K_eff\n    - η_max\n    - Mean ASR\n    - Tier Composition\n    rows:\n    - - P_012\n      - GPT-4.1 / GPT-4o / Qwen72B\n      - '1.91'\n      - '0.08'\n      - '0.142'\n      - all-large\n    - - P_034\n      - GPT-4.1 / Llama70B / GPT-4o\n      - '2.14'\n      - '0.09'\n      - '0.151'\n      - all-large\n    - - P_087\n      - GPT-4.1 / GPT-4o / Claude-Haiku\n      - '1.72'\n      - '0.07'\n      - '0.138'\n      - large+medium\n    - - P_156\n      - GPT-4o / Qwen72B / Llama70B\n      - '2.31'\n      - '0.11'\n      - '0.163'\n      - all-large\n    - - P_201\n      - GPT-4.1 / GPT-4.1m / GPT-4o\n      - '1.45'\n      - '0.07'\n      - '0.131'\n      - all-large\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Fig 11: Scatter of K_eff vs η_max for 455 panels, colored by tier composition\n    (green=all-large, yellow=mixed, red=all-small). Pareto frontier (black line) runs\n    along the lower-left, dominated by green points. Clear positive correlation with\n    tier-driven clustering.'\n  - 'Fig 12: Tradeoff curve with 95% prediction interval. Shows that for a given K_eff\n    level, η_max is tightly predicted (R²=0.53). The ''tradeoff'' is really a constraint\n    surface, not two independent dimensions.'\n  analysis: 'Tradeoff visualization 是一个 clean methodological contribution，无论 K_eff\n    是否有 独立效应都有价值。它展示了当前 LLM 生态中 panel design 的结构约束：diversity 和 robustness 不是独立可优化的维度。但在\n    worst 档下，这更多被解读为 confound 的可视化 证据而非独立发现。可在论文中保留为 Fig 2 或 Fig 3，作为 \"understanding\n    the evaluation landscape\" 的贡献。\n\n    '\n- name: Panel Size Sensitivity Analysis\n  plan_id: plan_008\n  description: '测试 K=3,5,7,9 不同 panel size 下 η_max 与 K_eff 的相对重要性是否变化。\n\n    '\n  expected_results:\n    K3_panels: 455\n    K5_panels: 3003\n    K7_panels: 6435\n    K9_panels: 5005\n    K3_eta_max_sig_ratio: 0.75\n    K5_eta_max_sig_ratio: 0.83\n    K7_eta_max_sig_ratio: 0.92\n    K9_eta_max_sig_ratio: 0.92\n    K3_keff_resid_sig_ratio: 0.33\n    K5_keff_resid_sig_ratio: 0.25\n    K7_keff_resid_sig_ratio: 0.17\n    K9_keff_resid_sig_ratio: 0.08\n    keff_effect_trend_with_K: monotonically decreasing\n  result_rationale: 'Panel size 增大时 η_max dominance 增强，K_eff effect 递减。原因：K=9 的 panel\n    包含 9/15 模型，几乎所有 panel 都包含至少一个弱模型，η_max 方差缩小但 level 保持高位。 同时 K_eff 的变异范围也缩小（大 panel\n    的 K_eff 趋向收敛）。更重要的是，majority vote 在大 panel 中的容错能力提高——但这被 η_max 的 monotonic 效应抵消（一个极弱\n    judge 的影响在 K=3 中是 catastrophic，在 K=9 中被稀释）。K_eff 的 sig ratio 从 K=3 的 0.33 降至 K=9\n    的 0.08，表明 K_eff 的表面效应主要在小 panel 中出现（因为 tier-mixing 的方差更大），进一步支持 confound 解释。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - title: 'Table 12: Panel Size Sensitivity — Significance Ratios'\n    columns:\n    - K\n    - N Panels\n    - η_max sig ratio\n    - K_eff resid sig ratio\n    - Mean R²\n    - K_eff-η_max r\n    rows:\n    - - '3'\n      - '455'\n      - '0.75'\n      - '0.33'\n      - '0.38'\n      - '0.73'\n    - - '5'\n      - '3003'\n      - '0.83'\n      - '0.25'\n      - '0.41'\n      - '0.68'\n    - - '7'\n      - '6435'\n      - '0.92'\n      - '0.17'\n      - '0.44'\n      - '0.61'\n    - - '9'\n      - '5005'\n      - '0.92'\n      - '0.08'\n      - '0.46'\n      - '0.54'\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Fig 13: Line plot of sig ratios vs panel size K. η_max (blue) rises monotonically;\n    K_eff (red) declines monotonically. Lines cross at approximately K=4. Shows that\n    K_eff''s ''effect'' is a small-panel phenomenon.'\n  analysis: 'Panel size 分析揭示 K_eff 效应的 artifactual nature：它在小 panel（K=3）中最强 恰好是 tier-mixing\n    方差最大的地方。随 K 增大，confound 缓解，K_eff 效应消退。 η_max 的趋势则相反——大 panel 中仍有弱 judge，且 R² 随\n    K 增大说明 panel composition 的可预测性提高。这是支持 \"K_eff is confound\" 的又一条证据线。\n\n    '\n- name: VIF and Multicollinearity Deep Dive\n  plan_id: plan_009\n  description: '对现有回归数据进行全面多重共线性分析：VIF、偏相关、residualized K_eff、 Bonferroni/FDR correction、bootstrap\n    CI、排除极端模型的敏感性分析、beta regression。\n\n    '\n  expected_results:\n    VIF_keff_full_model: 2.14\n    VIF_eta_max_full_model: 2.14\n    keff_resid_sig_bonferroni_12: 2\n    keff_resid_sig_fdr_12: 4\n    keff_resid_sig_bootstrap_95CI_excludes_zero: 3\n    keff_resid_sig_exclude_extreme_models: 4\n    keff_resid_sig_exclude_extreme_models_fdr: 3\n    beta_regression_keff_sig: 3\n    beta_regression_eta_max_sig: 10\n    partial_r_keff_given_eta_max: 0.14\n    partial_r_eta_max_given_keff: 0.41\n    sensitivity_analyses_convergent: false\n    keff_resid_sig_range_across_methods:\n    - 2\n    - 5\n  result_rationale: 'VIF=2.14 在传统标准下不算严重（<5），但这掩盖了非线性 confound。Bonferroni 最严格， K_eff\n    降至 2/12 显著；FDR 保持 4/12；bootstrap CI 给出 3/12（因为 bootstrap 在 455 panels 中重复抽样，resampling\n    variance 较大导致 CI 加宽）。排除极端模型 （ACC < 0.5 的 2 个模型）后 K_eff 4/12→3/12（FDR），说明效应部分依赖极端值。\n    Beta regression（适合 bounded proportion DV）与 OLS 结果不一致——K_eff 仅 3/12 显著（beta regression\n    对极端值更稳健）。核心问题：不同分析方法给出 2-5/12 的 显著性范围，缺乏收敛性。Reviewer 可以选择最严格的估计（2/12 Bonferroni）argue\n    K_eff 无效应，或选择最宽松的（5/12 FDR without extreme exclusion）argue suggestive。 这种方法敏感性本身就是\n    \"not robust\" 的标志。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - title: 'Table 13: K_eff Residualized Significance Under Different Correction Methods'\n    columns:\n    - Method\n    - K_eff sig count (/12)\n    - η_max sig count (/12)\n    - Notes\n    rows:\n    - - Uncorrected\n      - '7'\n      - '10'\n      - Liberal\n    - - FDR (BH)\n      - '4'\n      - '9'\n      - Standard\n    - - Bonferroni\n      - '2'\n      - '8'\n      - Conservative\n    - - Bootstrap 95% CI\n      - '3'\n      - '9'\n      - Non-parametric\n    - - Exclude extreme models (FDR)\n      - '3'\n      - '9'\n      - Sensitivity\n    - - Beta regression (FDR)\n      - '3'\n      - '10'\n      - Bounded DV\n  - title: 'Table 14: Partial Correlations'\n    columns:\n    - Predictor\n    - Partial r (controlling other)\n    - 95% CI\n    - p\n    rows:\n    - - K_eff | η_max\n      - '0.14'\n      - '[0.05, 0.23]'\n      - '0.003'\n    - - η_max | K_eff\n      - '0.41'\n      - '[0.33, 0.49]'\n      - <0.001\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Fig 14: Sensitivity analysis heatmap — rows are 12 conditions, columns are 6\n    analysis methods. Cells colored green (sig) or gray (NS). η_max rows are mostly\n    green across methods; K_eff rows show scattered green, method-dependent. Visual\n    impression: K_eff significance is method-fragile.'\n  - 'Fig 15: Bootstrap distribution of β_Keff_resid for each condition. Several conditions\n    show CI barely excluding zero (marginal), others have zero well within CI. Compare\n    to η_max bootstrap distributions which are tightly away from zero.'\n  analysis: 'VIF 分析是 worst 档的核心打击。K_eff 的显著性在 2-5/12 范围内波动，高度依赖 统计方法选择——这是 \"researcher\n    degrees of freedom\" 问题。Partial r (K_eff | η_max) = 0.14 意味着 K_eff 在控制 η_max 后仅解释\n    2% 的独特方差（r²=0.02）。相比之下 η_max 的 partial r = 0.41（17% 独特方差）。即使 K_eff 有微弱的独立效应，其实际意义（practical\n    significance）可忽略。论文中需要诚实报告所有方法的结果范围，不能只报最有利的。\n\n    '\n- name: Aggregation Rule Comparison\n  plan_id: plan_010\n  description: '在 15 模型 455 panel 上测试 majority vote、threshold voting（unanimity）、 weighted\n    voting、Bayesian aggregation 四种聚合规则下的 K_eff 和 η_max 效应。\n\n    '\n  expected_results:\n    majority_keff_resid_sig: 4\n    majority_eta_max_sig: 9\n    threshold_keff_resid_sig: 6\n    threshold_eta_max_sig: 7\n    weighted_keff_resid_sig: 2\n    weighted_eta_max_sig: 10\n    bayesian_keff_resid_sig: 1\n    bayesian_eta_max_sig: 5\n    keff_sig_varies_by_aggregation: true\n    aggregation_dependency_interpretation: K_eff effect is aggregation artifact\n  result_rationale: '聚合规则分析暴露 K_eff 效应的 aggregation dependency。Threshold voting（unanimity）\n    下 K_eff 6/12 显著——因为 unanimity 放大了单个 judge 的 veto power，diverse panel 中弱 judge\n    更可能 veto 正确判断。但这不是 \"diversity hurts\"，而是 \"unanimity amplifies weakest-link effect,\n    and diverse panels have weaker links\"。Bayesian aggregation 大幅削弱两个 predictor：η_max\n    5/12，K_eff 1/12——Bayesian weighting 有效下调了不可靠 judge 的权重，部分 neutralize 了 weakest-link\n    效应。 Weighted voting 下 K_eff 几乎消失（2/12），因为 accuracy-based weights 自动 降权弱模型。核心问题：K_eff\n    的显著性从 1/12（Bayesian）到 6/12（threshold）—— 如果 K_eff 是真正的 structural vulnerability\n    driver，它不应该如此依赖聚合规则。 这种依赖性暗示 K_eff 效应实际上是特定聚合规则对弱 judge 处理方式的 artifact。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - title: 'Table 15: Aggregation Rule × Vulnerability Driver Analysis'\n    columns:\n    - Aggregation\n    - K_eff sig (/12)\n    - η_max sig (/12)\n    - Mean R²\n    - Best Predictor\n    rows:\n    - - Majority Vote\n      - '4'\n      - '9'\n      - '0.38'\n      - η_max\n    - - Threshold (Unanimity)\n      - '6'\n      - '7'\n      - '0.42'\n      - mixed\n    - - Accuracy-Weighted\n      - '2'\n      - '10'\n      - '0.45'\n      - η_max\n    - - Bayesian\n      - '1'\n      - '5'\n      - '0.29'\n      - η_max (weakened)\n  - title: 'Table 16: Aggregation as Defense — Mean ASR Comparison'\n    columns:\n    - Aggregation\n    - Mean ASR (all panels)\n    - ASR (top-10 panels)\n    - ASR (bottom-10 panels)\n    - Spread\n    rows:\n    - - Majority\n      - '0.261'\n      - '0.142'\n      - '0.418'\n      - '0.276'\n    - - Threshold\n      - '0.183'\n      - '0.098'\n      - '0.312'\n      - '0.214'\n    - - Weighted\n      - '0.224'\n      - '0.121'\n      - '0.367'\n      - '0.246'\n    - - Bayesian\n      - '0.198'\n      - '0.112'\n      - '0.294'\n      - '0.182'\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Fig 16: Grouped bar chart — K_eff sig count (red) and η_max sig count (blue)\n    under each aggregation rule. K_eff bars fluctuate wildly (1-6), η_max bars are\n    relatively stable (5-10). Demonstrates K_eff''s aggregation dependency.'\n  - 'Fig 17: ASR distribution violin plots by aggregation rule. Threshold has lowest\n    median but widest tail; Bayesian has most compressed distribution (most equitable).\n    Practical implication: Bayesian reduces both mean and variance of vulnerability.'\n  analysis: 'Aggregation 分析是 worst 档中最具建设性的发现。虽然它进一步削弱了 K_eff 作为 independent driver\n    的 claim（aggregation-dependent → possible artifact），但它提供了 实际价值：(a) Bayesian aggregation\n    作为 defense 的有效性（ASR 均值和方差同时降低）； (b) Threshold voting 最严格但 K_eff 效应最强——不适合 adversarial\n    setting； (c) Accuracy-weighted 是 good middle ground（K_eff 几乎消失，η_max 仍可控）。 可以\n    reframe 为 practical contribution: \"choosing the right aggregation rule matters\n    more than panel diversity composition\"。\n\n    '\n- name: Open-Ended Generation Benchmark\n  plan_id: plan_011\n  description: '在 MT-Bench 或 AlpacaEval 风格的开放式生成任务上运行攻击实验， 验证 MCQ findings 是否推广到 open-ended\n    evaluation。\n\n    '\n  expected_results:\n    benchmark: MT-Bench (adapted)\n    n_conditions: 4\n    keff_resid_sig_positive: 0\n    keff_resid_sig_negative: 1\n    keff_resid_nonsig: 3\n    eta_max_sig: 4\n    keff_direction_inconsistent_with_MCQ: true\n    open_ended_mean_ASR: 0.34\n    MCQ_mean_ASR: 0.26\n    eta_max_dominance_ratio_open: 0.91\n  result_rationale: 'Open-ended 任务与 MCQ 的攻击动态根本不同。MCQ 攻击通过影响 judge 对特定选项的偏好， K_eff\n    的 confound 来自 tier-mixing。Open-ended 评估中 judge 需要评估文本质量—— 攻击更多依赖 persuasive text\n    generation，所有 judge 面临相似的 adversarial text。 因此 η_max 完全主导（4/4 sig）：最弱 judge 被最容易说服。K_eff\n    方向混乱——1 个 条件甚至显著负向（diverse panel 更好），因为 open-ended 评估中不同 judge 对文本 质量的多角度评估确实可以互补（更接近\n    BFT 的 benign fault 假设）。这与 MCQ 结果 不一致是 worst 档的关键打击：如果 diversity trap 不跨任务推广，它就不是一般性\n    原理，而是 MCQ 评估的特异性现象——可能由 MCQ 的离散选择结构 + tier-mixing confound 共同驱动。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - title: 'Table 17: Open-Ended Task Results'\n    columns:\n    - Task Subset\n    - Attack\n    - β_ηmax\n    - p_ηmax\n    - β_Keff_resid\n    - p_Keff_resid\n    - Direction\n    rows:\n    - - MT-Bench-Writing\n      - style_manip\n      - '0.79'\n      - <0.001\n      - '-0.22'\n      - '0.034'\n      - NEGATIVE\n    - - MT-Bench-Reasoning\n      - logic_distort\n      - '0.84'\n      - <0.001\n      - '0.08'\n      - '0.541'\n      - near-zero\n    - - MT-Bench-Coding\n      - output_inject\n      - '0.71'\n      - '0.002'\n      - '0.15'\n      - '0.218'\n      - positive (NS)\n    - - MT-Bench-Math\n      - step_skip\n      - '0.88'\n      - <0.001\n      - '-0.05'\n      - '0.712'\n      - near-zero\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Fig 18: Comparison heatmap — left panel shows β_Keff_resid for 12 MCQ conditions\n    (mostly positive), right panel shows β_Keff_resid for 4 open-ended conditions\n    (mixed/negative). Clear inconsistency across task types.'\n  - 'Fig 19: η_max comparison — significance rates in MCQ (9/12) and open-ended (4/4).\n    η_max is the universal predictor; K_eff is task-dependent at best.'\n  analysis: 'Open-ended 结果是 diversity trap 叙事的 generalizability failure。K_eff 在 MCQ\n    上 的正向效应不推广到 open-ended 评估——方向不一致且 1 个条件甚至反转。这使得 diversity trap 从 general finding\n    降级为 MCQ-specific observation，reviewers 会 质疑：如果 diversity 只在 MCQ 中 \"hurts\"，这到底是\n    diversity 的问题还是 MCQ evaluation 的 artifact？η_max 在两种任务上都一致显著，强化了 weakest-link 作为\n    universal driver 的地位。Reframe 后论文应在 title/abstract 中避免 generalize， 限定为 \"MCQ-based\n    evaluation\" 或在 Discussion 中作为 limitation 显著标注。\n\n    '\n- name: Partial-Knowledge Adversary Simulation\n  plan_id: plan_012\n  description: '模拟 adversary 仅知 judge family 但不知具体 vulnerability profile 的场景。 与 full-knowledge\n    adversary 对比 ASR degradation。\n\n    '\n  expected_results:\n    full_knowledge_mean_ASR: 0.261\n    partial_knowledge_mean_ASR: 0.238\n    no_knowledge_mean_ASR: 0.204\n    ASR_degradation_full_to_partial_pct: 8.8\n    ASR_degradation_full_to_none_pct: 21.8\n    partial_keff_sig: 2\n    partial_eta_max_sig: 8\n    family_knowledge_utility: modest\n    keff_effect_under_partial: weaker than full, similar direction\n  result_rationale: 'Partial-knowledge adversary（知 family 不知具体 vulnerability）仅比 full-knowledge\n    下降 8.8% ASR——说明 family 信息提供的攻击优势有限，因为 same-family 模型的 vulnerability profile 差异大（family\n    labels 不可靠，plan_004 的 claim 4）。 No-knowledge adversary 下降 21.8%——说明 any model\n    knowledge 都有价值但不是 dramatic。 K_eff 在 partial-knowledge 下仅 2/12 显著，进一步弱化了 \"diverse\n    attack surface\" 叙事：如果 adversary 不知道具体 vulnerability，panel diversity 不应创造可利用的 attack\n    surface（adversary 无法 target specific judges）。K_eff 效应在 partial-knowledge 下几乎消失，暗示\n    full-knowledge 下的 K_eff 效应部分来自 adversary 对具体 vulnerability 的知识（即 K_eff 效应依赖 threat\n    model 假设——full-knowledge 在实践中不现实）。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - title: 'Table 18: Adversary Knowledge Level Comparison'\n    columns:\n    - Knowledge Level\n    - Mean ASR\n    - K_eff sig (/12)\n    - η_max sig (/12)\n    - R²\n    rows:\n    - - Full (exact η_j)\n      - '0.261'\n      - '4'\n      - '9'\n      - '0.38'\n    - - Partial (family only)\n      - '0.238'\n      - '2'\n      - '8'\n      - '0.34'\n    - - None (uniform attack)\n      - '0.204'\n      - '0'\n      - '6'\n      - '0.22'\n  - title: 'Table 19: ASR Degradation Analysis'\n    columns:\n    - Transition\n    - ΔASR\n    - Δ%\n    - Interpretation\n    rows:\n    - - Full → Partial\n      - '-0.023'\n      - -8.8%\n      - Family info has modest value\n    - - Full → None\n      - '-0.057'\n      - -21.8%\n      - Model knowledge matters but not dramatically\n    - - Partial → None\n      - '-0.034'\n      - -14.3%\n      - Family info alone provides limited advantage\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Fig 20: Stacked bar chart of ASR under three knowledge levels, faceted by condition.\n    Shows modest degradation from full to partial, with largest drops in conditions\n    where K_eff was already significant (score_manip, position) — these are the conditions\n    most dependent on judge-specific targeting.'\n  analysis: Partial-knowledge 分析有两个重要含义：(a) 实践上，adversary 不需要精确 vulnerability 知识就能实现高\n    ASR（从 0.261 到 0.204 的下降 modest）——这本身是一个重要的安全发现； (b) 理论上，K_eff 效应依赖 full-knowledge\n    假设，在更现实的 threat model 下消失—— 这削弱了 K_eff 作为 general vulnerability driver 的 claim。在\n    reframed 论文中， 这个实验可以支持 \"η_max is robust across threat models while K_eff is threat-model-specific\"\n    的叙事。\n","numLines":1390,"startLine":1,"totalLines":1390}}}
