per Agent: methodology critical 修正（模型名 + MI 方法 + 实验细节）\\\\n- [ ] Paper Agent: Results 章节（含 P2b Reviewer-verified aggregation 数据）\\\\n- [ ] Dream report 处理\\\\n- [ ] Agent: 完整 15 模型列表\\\\n- [ ] Theorem 1 scope 更新\\\\n\\\\n## GPU 预算\\\\nseetacloud-rtx6000: 4× RTX 6000 96G（全空闲，写作阶段）\\\\n\\\\n## 目标\\\\nEMNLP 2026 via ARR | Contribution stack: 7 items | All analyses complete\\\\n\\\\n## 关键决策日志\\\\n\\\\n| ID | 日期 | 摘要 | 关联实验 |\\\\n|----|------|------|----------|\\\\n| D017 | 2026-05-22 | Claim 7 final (log-log canonical): Bayesian partia | plan001_step1_full_v4 |\\\\n| D016 | 2026-05-22 | Claim 7 revised: \\\\\\\"Bayesian breaks weakest-link\\\\\\\" fa | plan001_step1_full_v4 |\\\\n| D015 | 2026-05-22 | Claim 5 (Gaussian Copula Failure) falsified at 15- | worker_analysis_15model-family-copula |\\\\n| D014 | 2026-05-22 | 15-model 结果证伪原始 Claim 1 (\\\\\\\"K_eff irrelevant\\\\\\\")；K_eff | plan001_step1_full_v4 |\\\\n| D013 | 2026-05-22 | 7-model 预览显示 Claim 2 复活信号：random-fault K_eff gains | plan_001_7model_preview |\\\\n| D012 | 2026-05-22 | Plan_010 聚合实验完成：Bayesian 部分打破 weakest-link (3/12 v | plan_010 |\\\\n| D011 | 2026-05-22 | Plan_003 BFT contrast failed (0/12 random-fault K_ | plan_003 |\\\\n| D010 | 2026-05-22 | Dream review (2.5 all tiers) exposed 13 structural | — |\\\\n| D009 | 2026-05-22 | Taxonomy 验证失败（0/6 新条件 K_eff 显著），建议 kill 项目 | taxonomy-broad-spectrum |\\\\n| D008 | 2026-05-22 | MVP 原假设部分证伪：K_eff 仅对 shared-bias attacks 显著，η_max  | mvp-step2v3-retry3 |\\\\n\\\\n\\\\n\\\\n\\\", \\\"total_chars\\\": 2882, \\\"truncated\\\": false}, \\\"error\\\": null, \\\"metadata\\\": {}}\"}"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"toolu_015ojRATadn1hjRCkBCeyGqR","session_id":"4bd8a18a-978d-4865-811c-2ab932d2722c","uuid":"b4991f1f-34eb-408a-8418-0f21b088b23c","timestamp":"2026-05-22T18:48:54.744Z"}
