{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01Ef2TcUwuEFLMbwU2DPri7z","type":"tool_result","content":"{\"result\":\"{\\\"success\\\": true, \\\"data\\\": {\\\"path\\\": \\\"/home/ubuntu/.agent-ml-research-idea_gen_0519_2/projects/cert_manip_resist_eval/decisions.yaml\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"_next_id: 18\\\\ndecisions:\\\\n- id: D001\\\\n  date: 2026-05-21 16:31 UTC\\\\n  summary: MVP 方案：API 模型验证 K_eff 对操纵抗性的预测力，三步验证（相关性测量→攻击抗性 scaling→K_eff 回归）\\\\n  rationale: 项目核心假设是 K_eff 公式能预测多 judge 面板的操纵抗性。MVP 用 API 模型而非开源模型，因为：(1) 无需 GPU 配置，分钟级启动；(2)\\\\n    API 模型覆盖多家族（OpenAI/Anthropic/Google/DeepSeek/Qwen），足以验证 cross-family vs within-family\\\\n    相关性差异；(3) 核心假设与模型部署方式无关——如果 K_eff 在 API 模型上不 work，在开源模型上也不会 work。外部评审 FAILED (35%)\\\\n    但理论框架可修正，需先验证经验基础再投入理论修正。\\\\n  related_experiments: []\\\\n  depends_on: []\\\\n- id: D002\\\\n  date: 2026-05-21 16:37 UTC\\\\n  summary: MVP v2：基于 Reviewer 反馈修正统计设计，四步验证（相关性→homo/hetero 对照→K_eff 公式验证→scaling\\\\n    分析）\\\\n  rationale: Reviewer 指出 v1 五个问题：(1) K=1/3/5 仅 3 点无统计效力；(2) \\\\\\\"ASR 随 K 递减\\\\\\\"是 trivial\\\\n    gate，需 homo vs hetero 对照；(3) kill criteria 缺操作定义；(4) MI 估计器未指定；(5) K_eff 公式本身未验证。v2\\\\n    全部修正：新增 Step 2 homo/hetero panel 对照（核心 kill criterion）、Step 3 formula vs empirical\\\\n    effective rank 验证、K 扩展至 1/2/3/4/5/7 + attack×dataset 交叉产生 ≥15 数据点、MI 用 plug-in\\\\n    + Miller-Madow、kill criteria 操作化（bootstrap CI/≥80% 配置/配对检验 p<0.05）。\\\\n  related_experiments: []\\\\n  depends_on:\\\\n  - D001\\\\n- id: D003\\\\n  date: 2026-05-21 17:06 UTC\\\\n  summary: MVP 改用开源模型在 GPU 服务器运行，取消 API 依赖\\\\n  rationale: 用户催促推进（\\\\\\\"push\\\\\\\"），API keys 迟迟未提供成为阻塞项。已有 4× RTX 6000 96G，可跑 4 个 70B 级开源模型（Qwen-72B\\\\n    / Llama-70B / Mistral-Large / Qwen-32B），覆盖 3 个家族 + 1 个 same-family 对照，满足 homo/hetero\\\\n    对比需求。开源模型还有可复现性优势。\\\\n  related_experiments: []\\\\n  depends_on:\\\\n  - D002\\\\n- id: D004\\\\n  date: 2026-05-21 22:26 UTC\\\\n  summary: Step 1 结果显示 family diversity ≠ effective diversity；Step 2 对照组从 homo/hetero-family\\\\n    改为 high-K_eff vs low-K_eff panels\\\\n  rationale: 6 模型全量数据：within-family MI vs cross-family MI 无统计显著差异（MMLU p=0.218, ARC\\\\n    p=0.427）。大模型间 cross-family MI (0.487) 甚至高于最强 within-family pair (0.451)。原因：模型能力接近度而非家族身份驱动相关性。K_eff\\\\n    框架本身 agnostic——不关心 MI 来源，仍可能有效。但原始 Step 2 设计（K=3 same-family vs K=3 cross-family）已失去意义。改为直接用\\\\n    Step 1 实测 MI 计算各 panel 的 K_eff，对比 high-K_eff vs low-K_eff panels 的 ASR。这是更干净的测试，且\\\\\\\"family\\\\n    ≠ diversity\\\\\\\"本身是值得报告的发现。\\\\n  related_experiments: []\\\\n  depends_on:\\\\n  - D002\\\\n  - D003\\\\n- id: D005\\\\n  date: 2026-05-21 22:50 UTC\\\\n  summary: MI-based K_eff 为主指标，ρ-based 降为参考；Gaussian copula 全面失败（偏离 10-21×）作为论文发现之一\\\\n  rationale: Copula GoF 全量数据：MI_observed/MI_gaussian 均值 MMLU 21.1×、ARC 10.4×，14-15/15\\\\n    pairs 偏离 >2×。极端 case Mistral-Large↔Qwen-14B ρ≈0 但 MI=0.1-0.2（纯非线性依赖）。ρ-based K_eff\\\\n    对此 pair 会算出\\\\\\\"完全独立\\\\\\\"（1-0.001≈1），严重高估 panel independence。MI-based K_eff 直接使用观测信息量，不依赖\\\\n    Gaussian 假设，是唯一合理选择。论文中 copula 偏离本身作为 methodological finding 报告：\\\\\\\"LLM judge 间存在大量非线性依赖，线性相关系数系统性低估信息共享。\\\\\\\"\\\\n  related_experiments: []\\\\n  depends_on:\\\\n  - D004\\\\n- id: D006\\\\n  date: 2026-05-21 23:24 UTC\\\\n  summary: 论文 framing 降级：'certifiable' → 'quantifiable/measurable'；K_eff 理论定位从 proven\\\\n    bound 改为 Gaussian-motivated + empirically validated metric\\\\n  rationale: Reviewer 逐步审查 T1 证明链：K_eff = 1+(K-1)·exp(-2·I_max) 的上界性质（Step 3-5）依赖\\\\n    Gaussian compound symmetric 假设。Copula GoF 确认 LLM judge 分布偏离 Gaussian 10-21×。非\\\\n    Gaussian 下只有 trivial bound η_joint ≤ K·η_max，K_eff 公式不保证是 η_joint 的上界。因此不能 claim\\\\n    \\\\\\\"certifiable manipulation resistance\\\\\\\"。MI plug-in 估计可靠（正偏差是保守方向）。贡献栈调整：Gaussian\\\\n    下的 bound 作为 theoretical motivation，MI-based K_eff 作为 empirically validated diversity\\\\n    metric，copula 偏离和家族标签不可靠作为 methodological findings。Step 4 是论文去向的决定性测试。\\\\n  related_experiments: []\\\\n  depends_on:\\\\n  - D005\\\\n- id: D007\\\\n  date: 2026-05-22 01:08 UTC\\\\n  summary: Step 2 反转：K_eff 被 individual robustness confound 淹没，选 Option A 控制变量重跑\\\\n  rationale: High K_eff panels 全含 llama-8b（弱模型→低MI→高K_eff 但个体脆弱），Low K_eff panels\\\\n    全大模型（相关但个体强健）。ASR 反转不代表 K_eff 无效，而是被 robustness confound 掩盖。选 Option A：只用 4 个大模型(72B/70B/32B/Mistral-Large)的\\\\n    C(4,3)=4 panels 控制个体鲁棒性后重测。同时计算 single-judge ASR 量化 confound。Option B（修改公式）和 C（reframe）在\\\\n    A 结果出来前都为时过早。\\\\n  related_experiments:\\\\n  - exp_id: mvp-step2-keff-contrast\\\\n    role: evidence\\\\n    result: negative-confounded\\\\n  depends_on:\\\\n  - D004\\\\n  - D005\\\\n- id: D008\\\\n  date: 2026-05-22 03:21 UTC\\\\n  summary: MVP 原假设部分证伪：K_eff 仅对 shared-bias attacks 显著，η_max 主导 targeted attacks。探索\\\\n    attack-conditioned 双因子框架。\\\\n  rationale: 20-panel 多元回归 log(ASR)~log(K_eff)+log(η_max) 结果：K_eff 显著为负仅 1/6（arc×sycophancy\\\\n    β=-2.85 p=0.003），η_max 显著为正 4/6。攻击分类：targeted attacks（prompt injection, score\\\\n    manipulation）ASR≈f(η_max)，K_eff 无关；broad-spectrum attacks（sycophancy/共享偏差）ASR\\\\n    受 K_eff 影响。不立即 pivot 到 Path B（weakest-link reframe），先验证 attack taxonomy——增加 2-3\\\\n    种 broad-spectrum 攻击看 K_eff 是否一致有效。如果一致 → attack-conditioned K_eff theory（Path\\\\n    A 升级版）；如果不一致 → 全面 pivot 到 Path B。\\\\n  related_experiments:\\\\n  - exp_id: mvp-step2v3-retry3\\\\n    role: evidence\\\\n    result: partial-negative\\\\n  depends_on:\\\\n  - D007\\\\n- id: D009\\\\n  date: 2026-05-22 04:56 UTC\\\\n  summary: Taxonomy 验证失败（0/6 新条件 K_eff 显著），建议 kill 项目\\\\n  rationale: 12 条件全景：K_eff 显著为负仅 1/12（arc×sycophancy，Bonferroni 勉强通过，同类攻击不复现，降级为孤立异常）。η_max\\\\n    显著 7/12 但\\\\\\\"最弱评委决定安全性\\\\\\\"可能被审稿人视为 trivial。Reviewer 评估当前 2.0-2.5，扩展后最高 3.0-3.5，不够 AAAI\\\\n    main（3.5+）。贡献栈过薄：负结果（K_eff 无效）+ 弱正结果（η_max 主导但可能 obvious）+ 方法论（copula 失败）无法支撑\\\\n    A 类投稿。\\\\n  related_experiments:\\\\n  - exp_id: taxonomy-broad-spectrum\\\\n    role: evidence\\\\n    result: negative\\\\n  depends_on:\\\\n  - D008\\\\n- id: D010\\\\n  date: 2026-05-22 06:58 UTC\\\\n  summary: Dream review (2.5 all tiers) exposed 13 structural issues; proceed with\\\\n    fixes, NOT kill\\\\n  rationale: 'Dream dream_20260522T055016 returned 2.5 (Borderline Findings) across\\\\n    best/median/worst — flat scoring indicates structural issues not data-dependent.\\\\n    Key fixes: (1) Theorem 1 proof gap — must account for ⌈K/2⌉ majority requirement;\\\\n    (2) Novelty reframe — acknowledge weakest-link known in security, position as\\\\n    first empirical quantification in LLM-judge domain; (3) VIF/multicollinearity\\\\n    analysis on existing data; (4) Multiple comparison correction; (5) Non-majority-vote\\\\n    aggregation; (6) Open-ended benchmark beyond MCQ; (7) \\\\\\\"When diversity helps\\\\\\\" section.\\\\n    User confirmed continue (not kill), target EMNLP 2026, GPUs unlimited. Immediate\\\\n    actions: plan_009 (VIF analysis, P0, no GPU), plan_001 (model expansion, P0),\\\\n    plan_003 (formal theorem, P0). Framing updated to v3.'\\\\n  related_experiments: []\\\\n  depends_on:\\\\n  - D009\\\\n- id: D011\\\\n  date: 2026-05-22 07:08 UTC\\\\n  summary: Plan_003 BFT contrast failed (0/12 random-fault K_eff significant); Claim\\\\n    2 conditional on plan_001 model expansion\\\\n  rationale: 'Random-fault simulation showed K_eff 0/12 significant negative — same\\\\n    as adaptive (1/12). BFT vs adaptive contrast cannot be demonstrated with current\\\\n    6-model pool due to K_eff-η_max structural confound. R² difference (adaptive 0.14-0.73\\\\n    vs random-fault 0.55-0.95) is the only positive finding. Reviewer recommends:\\\\n    don''t reframe Claim 2 yet, wait for plan_001 (15+ models) which may break the\\\\n    confound. If plan_001 also fails to show K_eff distinction → Claim 2 must be dropped,\\\\n    ceiling falls to ~2.5-3.0. Theorem 1 direction adjusted: prove monotonicity in\\\\n    η_max (option b) rather than K_eff regime distinction.'\\\\n  related_experiments:\\\\n  - exp_id: plan_003\\\\n    role: go/no-go gate\\\\n    result: failed — 0/12 K_eff significant under random faults\\\\n  depends_on:\\\\n  - D010\\\\n- id: D012\\\\n  date: 2026-05-22 12:16 UTC\\\\n  summary: Plan_010 聚合实验完成：Bayesian 部分打破 weakest-link (3/12 vs 8/12)，threshold 下 diversity\\\\n    有害。纳入 Claim 7，Theorem 1 加 scope qualifier。\\\\n  rationale: 6 模型初步结果显示聚合规则显著调制 weakest-link 效应：majority/weighted 下 η_max 7-8/12 显著（Theorem\\\\n    1 成立），Bayesian 下仅 3/12（reliability weighting 降低弱 judge 影响），threshold 下 K_eff 正向显著（diversity\\\\n    在 unanimity 下有害）。Reviewer 确认方向有效但标 2 个 warning：(1) Bayesian 用同数据集 clean accuracy\\\\n    有信息泄漏嫌疑；(2) 缺 FDR 校正。两者在 15 模型版本中修复。该发现将论文从 negative-only 升级为 negative + positive\\\\n    prescription，增加实用价值。\\\\n  related_experiments:\\\\n  - exp_id: plan_010\\\\n    role: primary\\\\n    result: positive — aggregation modulates weakest-link\\\\n  depends_on:\\\\n  - D010\\\\n- id: D013\\\\n  date: 2026-05-22 15:11 UTC\\\\n  summary: 7-model 预览显示 Claim 2 复活信号：random-fault K_eff gains 6/12（vs plan_003 的 0/12），ΔR²=+0.237。η_max\\\\n    提升到 10/12。等 15-model 455 panels 确认。\\\\n  rationale: '加入 claude-3-haiku（跨族 + 弱模型）后 confound 方向反转（r=+0.473），打破了 plan_003 时的结构性假阴性。Random-fault\\\\n    下 K_eff 6/12 显著优于 adaptive 的 0-1/12，初步恢复了 BFT adaptive/random-fault 对比的核心叙事。但仅\\\\n    35 panels 统计功效有限，且主要由 haiku 单点驱动。15-model 全量结果（ETA 8-10h）是最终判定。如果复现 → Claim 2\\\\n    恢复为 #2 贡献；如果不复现 → 维持 conditional。'\\\\n  related_experiments:\\\\n  - exp_id: plan_001_7model_preview\\\\n    role: primary\\\\n    result: positive signal — confound broken, Claim 2 revival, η_max 10/12\\\\n  depends_on:\\\\n  - D011\\\\n  - D012\\\\n- id: D014\\\\n  date: 2026-05-22 17:16 UTC\\\\n  summary: 15-model 结果证伪原始 Claim 1 (\\\\\\\"K_eff irrelevant\\\\\\\")；K_eff 12/12 显著正，diversity\\\\n    有害。Paper framing 需从 v3 升级到 v4\\\\n  rationale: '15-model/455-panel regression: K_eff 12/12 FDR sig positive (β>0), η_max\\\\n    9/12 sig。在 2 个 confound-free 条件 (r≈0.35, VIF≈1.14) 中 K_eff 仍极显著 (p=6e-26, 4e-16)，排除\\\\n    confound artifact 可能。Sensitivity (排除 ACC<0.5) 11/12 仍显著。论文叙事需从 \\\\\\\"diversity doesn''t\\\\n    help\\\\\\\" 转向 \\\\\\\"diversity actively hurts, mechanism = diversity-capability tradeoff\\\\\\\"。Claim\\\\n    1 与 Claim 3 合并为更强结论。等待 residualized K_eff 分析确认独立效应强度。'\\\\n  related_experiments:\\\\n  - exp_id: plan001_step1_full_v4\\\\n    role: primary\\\\n    result: K_eff 12/12 sig positive, η_max 9/12 sig\\\\n  depends_on:\\\\n  - D013\\\\n  - D012\\\\n- id: D015\\\\n  date: 2026-05-22 18:05 UTC\\\\n  summary: Claim 5 (Gaussian Copula Failure) falsified at 15-model scale; removed\\\\n    from contribution stack\\\\n  rationale: '15-model copula analysis: MI_obs/MI_gaussian ratio = 0.93 (MMLU), 0.90\\\\n    (ARC robust). 6-model 10-21× was small-sample artifact (15→105 pairs diluted extreme\\\\n    values). Only haiku pairs show extreme ratios (212×). Claim downgraded to minor\\\\n    observation. Contribution stack reduced from 8 to 7.'\\\\n  related_experiments:\\\\n  - exp_id: worker_analysis_15model-family-copula\\\\n    role: falsified Claim 5\\\\n    result: ratio ~0.9, copula fits well\\\\n  depends_on:\\\\n  - D014\\\\n- id: D016\\\\n  date: 2026-05-22 18:20 UTC\\\\n  summary: 'Claim 7 revised: \\\\\\\"Bayesian breaks weakest-link\\\\\\\" falsified → \\\\\\\"Bayesian\\\\n    mitigates diversity-as-vulnerability while η_max remains dominant\\\\\\\"'\\\\n  rationale: '15-model P2 aggregation results: η_max remains 12/12 FDR sig under Bayesian\\\\n    (vs 3/12 at 6 models — original claim was scale artifact). But K_eff sig drops\\\\n    from 12/12 (majority) to 5/12 (Bayesian), β direction partially flips (3/12 negative).\\\\n    Bayesian calibration suppresses the harmful diversity effect without weakening\\\\n    weakest-link protection. New narrative: aggregation method modulates diversity\\\\n    vulnerability, not weakest-link dominance. Prescriptive angle: practitioners should\\\\n    prefer Bayesian calibration to mitigate diversity-as-vulnerability.'\\\\n  related_experiments:\\\\n  - exp_id: plan001_step1_full_v4\\\\n    role: P2 aggregation source data\\\\n    result: majority K_eff 12/12 positive → bayesian K_eff 5/12 with 3 neg; η_max\\\\n      12/12 stable across all methods\\\\n  depends_on:\\\\n  - D014\\\\n  - D012\\\\n- id: D017\\\\n  date: 2026-05-22 18:39 UTC\\\\n  summary: 'Claim 7 final (log-log canonical): Bayesian partially mitigates BOTH drivers\\\\n    — η_max 11→9/12, K_eff flips to 4/5 negative (protective). D016 level-level numbers\\\\n    superseded.'\\\\n  rationale: 'P2b log-log canonical rerun resolves spec inconsistency (Reviewer #1).\\\\n    Majority row sanity-checks against dominance canonical. Under Bayesian: η_max\\\\n    drops from 11/12 to 9/12 (weakest-link partially weakened), K_eff 4/5 significant\\\\n    coefficients are negative (diversity becomes protective). Threshold shows R²=0.901\\\\n    (near-perfect dual-driver fit under unanimity). Weighted is strongest dual-driver\\\\n    (K_eff 11/12 all positive). The aggregation gradient (majority→weighted→threshold→bayesian)\\\\n    reveals how different voting rules modulate the diversity channel and weakest-link\\\\n    channel independently.'\\\\n  related_experiments:\\\\n  - exp_id: plan001_step1_full_v4\\\\n    role: P2b log-log aggregation source\\\\n    result: majority η_max 11/12 K_eff 8/12(7+1-) | weighted 11/12 11/12(11+) | threshold\\\\n      12/12 11/12(10+1-) R²=0.90 | bayesian 9/12 5/12(1+4-)\\\\n  depends_on:\\\\n  - D016\\\\n  - D014\\\\n\\\", \\\"total_chars\\\": 12035, \\\"truncated\\\": false}, \\\"error\\\": null, \\\"metadata\\\": {}}\"}"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"toolu_015ojRATadn1hjRCkBCeyGqR","session_id":"4bd8a18a-978d-4865-811c-2ab932d2722c","uuid":"2470de17-1c6a-479b-b490-127bcbd2eda7","timestamp":"2026-05-22T18:49:35.146Z"}
